'),('437954f4-4472-47d3-8a5c-b7dacf9a4fe4','template','','889b49f4-1265-4a71-a900-8d10059912ea','Post','2022-04-07 05:00:18','2022-04-07 05:00:18'),('c01d4bb3-9bb2-41ef-b2c4-6ca27f13194e','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/semana9.jpeg','0cd235b1-a27c-4a42-a4a1-c8fddcd992c6','Post','2022-01-10 22:45:22','2022-01-10 22:45:22'),('9503991a-7713-45ea-892b-9fbe9707138e','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','0cd235b1-a27c-4a42-a4a1-c8fddcd992c6','Post','2022-01-10 22:46:19','2022-01-10 22:46:19'),('55dcba5f-c68b-4716-8b14-069936d6aeb2','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tortuga.jpeg','02db4255-e96a-40af-8c48-fb769bf01a98','Post','2021-12-06 01:16:47','2021-12-06 01:16:47'),('43aec545-08b9-47cd-914a-e51e3a3346f0','_default','{\"draft_status\":\"draft_child\",\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','02db4255-e96a-40af-8c48-fb769bf01a98','Post','2021-12-06 01:18:05','2021-12-06 01:19:05'),('a85a997d-34c5-4793-82dc-bdfd7dd2a68a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/foto_nwe.png','87c26f65-a117-4a16-bfb0-fe478e0ec0bb','Post','2021-12-31 23:51:17','2022-01-19 00:13:44'),('a635bc6f-346d-4795-8c9c-2a0dc1c15631','thumb','','889b49f4-1265-4a71-a900-8d10059912ea','Post','2022-04-07 05:00:18','2022-04-07 05:00:18'),('25aa2ada-3941-4077-b85b-e7e357b03b3c','summary','<!--:es-->Durante la última semana de junio, Fundación La Tortuga con su Proyecto RAO Anzoátegui, acompañó a Fundación Empresas Polar en la celebración de la \"Semana de la Conservación\", evento permanente de esta organización, que busca brindar a los niños y niñas de las comunidades cercanas a su planta ubicada en Barcelona, actividades lúdicas ambientales y así forjar al ciudadano del futuro con más conciencia y sensibilidad ecológica.<!--:--><!--:en-->During the last week of June, La Tortuga Foundation with its RAO Anzoátegui Project, accompanied Fundación Empresas Polar in the celebration of the \"Conservation Week\", a permanent event of this organization, which seeks to provide children from the communities near its plant located in Barcelona, environmental recreational activities and thus forge the citizen of the future with more awareness and ecological sensitivity.<!--:-->','0cd235b1-a27c-4a42-a4a1-c8fddcd992c6','Post','2022-01-10 22:45:22','2022-01-10 22:49:18'),('d8e85802-4edc-4a63-a420-5fd89a203d04','summary','<!--:es-->Durante la última semana de junio, Fundación La Tortuga con su Proyecto RAO Anzoátegui, acompañó a Fundación Empresas Polar en la celebración de la \"Semana de la Conservación\", evento permanente de esta organización, que busca brindar a los niños y niñas de las comunidades cercanas a su planta ubicada en Barcelona, actividades lúdicas ambientales y así forjar al ciudadano del futuro con más conciencia y sensibilidad ecológica.<!--:--><!--:en-->During the last week of June, La Tortuga Foundation with its RAO Anzoátegui Project, accompanied Fundación Empresas Polar in the celebration of the \"Conservation Week\", a permanent event of this organization, which seeks to provide children from the communities near its plant located in Barcelona, environmental recreational activities and thus forge the citizen of the future with more awareness and ecological sensitivity.<!--:-->','63ecebae-2564-4efd-bb39-5e47d8fd0e05','Post','2022-01-10 22:41:35','2022-01-10 22:49:19'),('463b3f0c-a1aa-4755-addf-62a4dc66dd8d','slug','ambientarrrt-dejo-huella-en-caracas,ambientarrrt-left-its-mark-in-caracas','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('2bee1ae0-9b10-4869-89c7-fab0683b7d13','slug','de-nuevo-con-ferreterias-epa,again-with-ferreterias-epa','3f382e7e-26e4-419e-ae70-546e2de0a6c6','Post','2022-01-27 21:17:38','2022-01-27 21:17:38'),('d4ee0af7-969e-42f3-bf9e-51444d8b34aa','summary','<!--:es-->Nuevamente Fundación La Tortuga será beneficiada a través del Programa \"Ayudar es Sencillo\" de Ferreterías EPA, el cual consiste en el aporte voluntario de los clientes al momento de pagar sus compras. Ya el año pasado gracias al aporte obtenido se puso en marcha de manera formal el Proyecto \"RAO Anzoátegui\"/ Red de Aviso Oportuno que acaba de cumplir su primer año de trabajo mediante el monitoreo de las poblaciones de Tortugas Marinas en el estado Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->Once again, Fundación La Tortuga will benefit from the \"Ayudar es Sencillo\" program of Ferreterías EPA, which consists of voluntary contributions from customers when paying for their purchases. Last year, thanks to the contribution obtained, the \"RAO Anzoátegui\"/ Red de Aviso Oportuno Project was formally launched, which has just completed its first year of work by monitoring sea turtle populations in the state of Anzoátegui.<!--:-->','3f382e7e-26e4-419e-ae70-546e2de0a6c6','Post','2022-01-27 21:17:38','2022-01-27 21:17:38'),('9aa5adc4-8b2a-4ea8-9976-0dbd46289e09','slug','pagia,pagia-para-unomia','4f0ede70-a19f-46d8-afaa-7bf9a4cd3ea5','Post','2022-01-15 16:40:09','2022-01-15 16:40:09'),('041e7fb7-5111-4eef-8677-950ec7e7c811','template','template_page','4f0ede70-a19f-46d8-afaa-7bf9a4cd3ea5','Post','2022-01-15 16:40:09','2022-01-15 16:40:09'),('2c0ed04d-3fe0-43e4-8d40-e5fe1b6922bc','layout','index','4f0ede70-a19f-46d8-afaa-7bf9a4cd3ea5','Post','2022-01-15 16:40:09','2022-01-15 16:40:09'),('9966703e-2eb6-43b0-8b0f-80715f6b112c','thumb','','4f0ede70-a19f-46d8-afaa-7bf9a4cd3ea5','Post','2022-01-15 16:40:09','2022-01-15 16:40:09'),('11ead8da-563f-4494-b9ee-0a48e42bc65b','template','','3f382e7e-26e4-419e-ae70-546e2de0a6c6','Post','2022-01-27 21:17:38','2022-01-27 21:17:38'),('937ba907-2fb1-46fb-92cf-26568b12f829','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','924b