idas,','889b49f4-1265-4a71-a900-8d10059912ea','Post','2022-04-07 05:00:18','2022-04-07 05:21:19'),('8222ca1d-82ff-477d-b1bc-c331cff3a8b7','has_comments','1','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('e2d31c92-a2fc-4778-8894-5621bb921ef3','summary','<!--:es-->Dentro de los objetivos de la Fundación La Tortuga, se encuentra el desarrollo de proyectos de educación no formal. La idea es llevar un mensaje ambiental a todos los espacios posibles y a todos los niveles. La evidencia de este compromiso se destaca con la realización de talleres formativos-educativos, así como de otras actividades en la fundación y en las comunidades. Todas ellas con miras en la generación de una conciencia ambiental en los ciudadanos.<!--:--><!--:en-->One of the objectives of La Tortuga Foundation is the development of non-formal education projects. The idea is to bring an environmental message to all possible spaces and at all levels. The evidence of this commitment is highlighted by the realization of educational-training workshops, as well as other activities in the foundation and in the communities. All of these activities are aimed at generating environmental awareness among citizens.<!--:-->','7f71356a-afc5-4779-b311-2e071f32633f','Post','2022-01-01 02:18:11','2022-01-19 00:13:04'),('de07ccb0-6bc4-4605-b8be-7d8c64a3e506','summary','<!--:es-->Una divertida cita se llevó a cabo en la Librería +Libros de Lechería cuando la experta teatral Celi Borges, se hizo acompañar de la Tortuga \"Elisa\" y compartió con los niños presentes las aventuras de un tigre antojado en pintar al mundo de color negro y amarillo como él.<!--:--><!--:en-->A fun event took place at the +Libros Bookstore in Lechería when the theater expert Celi Borges, accompanied by the Turtle \"Elisa\", shared with the children present the adventures of a tiger eager to paint the world black and yellow like him.<!--:-->','24a36485-73b1-4ff1-aa3e-9aff7532edc3','Post','2022-01-27 23:02:36','2022-01-27 23:02:36'),('8847acb3-716b-4726-9275-ef819f02a895','_default','{\"has_category\":false,\"has_tags\":false,\"has_summary\":false,\"has_content\":true,\"has_comments\":false,\"has_picture\":true,\"has_template\":true,\"has_seo\":true,\"not_deleted\":true,\"has_layout\":true,\"default_layout\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\",\"default_template\":\"\",\"has_single_category\":false,\"has_featured\":false,\"has_parent_structure\":false,\"posts_image_dimension\":\"\",\"posts_thumb_versions\":\"\",\"posts_thumb_size\":\"\",\"is_required_picture\":false,\"contents_route_format\":\"post\",\"default_thumb\":\"\",\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','1172e39a-5838-4452-b917-ff217a01bec7','PostType','2021-12-05 01:43:10','2021-12-09 18:38:54'),('16993267-6c47-4195-bca2-eb57dd4c9665','template','','24a36485-73b1-4ff1-aa3e-9aff7532edc3','Post','2022-01-27 23:02:36','2022-01-27 23:02:36'),('89a02539-f145-49fc-9e72-677b0b68a4e5','has_comments','1','24a36485-73b1-4ff1-aa3e-9aff7532edc3','Post','2022-01-27 23:02:36','2022-01-27 23:02:36'),('b7d92b0a-49e5-477a-831c-3851156ef717','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/celi2.jpg','24a36485-73b1-4ff1-aa3e-9aff7532edc3','Post','2022-01-27 23:02:36','2022-01-27 23:02:36'),('06ad9563-4d61-46da-b403-39e98d47fbe1','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','24a36485-73b1-4ff1-aa3e-9aff7532edc3','Post','2022-01-27 23:02:36','2022-01-27 23:02:36'),('a85153c2-a0e0-4768-a66d-3b072777a8ea','template','','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('17cf4cac-53a4-4251-a784-170fe24e5322','has_comments','1','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('00d26404-4d0f-47e6-8040-11d686cba292','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/festival-acuatico-promueve-preservacion-del-ambiente.jpg','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('575757da-5256-4c59-b87b-db2ad0f8bf55','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('ab76aba0-7cb1-4338-9818-89ac98c0180e','summary','<!--:es-->Con la crisis ambiental global que estamos experimentando, en la Isla La Tortuga se pretende, “aparentemente” sin los indispensables estudios de impacto ambiental, explotar, a la brevedad, “ecoturística y sustentablemente”, los prístinos recursos naturales y paisajísticos de la isla y sus cayos, a saber: hábitat marinos y submarinos, lagunetas y salinetas, yacimientos arqueológicos y paleoantropológicos, biota terrestre y acuática endémica.<!--:--><!--:en-->With the global environmental crisis we are experiencing, in La Tortuga Island it is intended, \"apparently\" without the necessary environmental impact studies, to exploit, as soon as possible, \"ecotourism and sustainably\", the pristine natural and scenic resources of the island and its keys, namely: marine and underwater habitats, lagoons, and salt flats, archaeological and paleoanthropological sites, endemic terrestrial and aquatic biota.<!--:-->','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('4a964da1-0461-4bec-8ec9-ed500b066ece','template','','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('0c29ebd4-3cc6-457e-9c3d-aee4c93321cd','has_comments','1','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('dbe90bba-e881-4886-9fe8-daeb0816f215','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/isla-la-tortuga-jvoglar-foto_archivo.jpg','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('4b90d3e6-ca0e-476e-a228-70de27307790','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('f269a686-a422-4e2c-80a2-cb409ab10f93','template','template_page','2f99e394-f9cf-4cbb-96b8-ff74783ac7ad','Post','2022-05-03 17:51:45','2022-05-29 13:31:50'),('5dc57f96-9345-40db-9632-df6828774dd7','slug','el-ambiente-la-economia-y-espiritualidad-se-convierten-en-una-sola,environment-economy-and-spirituality-become-one','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('3770ecb9-8b39-447c-9002-27c175bfdc55','summary','<!--:es-->Debemos lograr un verdadero desarrollo sustentable, que permita a nuestra generación satisfacer sus necesidades sin sacrificar a las generaciones futuras, afirmó Alfredo Sfeir-Younis, economista ambiental y líder espiritual.<!--:--><!--:en-->We must achieve a true sustainable development that allows our generation to satisfy its needs without sacrificing future generations, said Alfredo Sfeir-Younis, environmental economist and spiritual leader.<!--:-->','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('48bc7936-04ac-4560-b628-7d10301a3ccd','template','','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('7a637965-9db1-47d4-b5bf-99990ff0f73d','has_comments','1','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('2d377e25-ea4a-48d1-b3e7-ccf6e3417db9','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/stones-g310fda724_640.jpg','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('d844562a-38d4-4102-8257-95d63b322c5d','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','9810f669-9c2a-4d22-aac2-07107a5e2a33','Post','2022-01-27 20:28:43','2022-01-27 20:28:43'),('45189b4a-0a90-4934-b26b-8a1c5f3e8dbe','slug','la-extincion-en-el-oceano,extinction-in-the-ocean','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('db50319e-53b1-4247-8220-f59394bb8bf0','template','','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-19 00:53:44'),('0de141b8-fbbd-46c4-9878-dc4ad1e9d7c1','visits','2642','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-30 03:31:02','2024-06-30 09:25:34'),('04978c2b-6d2a-4327-928a-5772328333c0','slug','festival-acuatico-promueve-la-preservacion-del-ambiente,aquatic-festival-promotes-environmental-preservation','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('c2a7fe45-4128-4f74-ab36-5d614ac953e4','summary','<!--:es-->Con el transcurrir de los años, las actividades de turismo y deporte de aventura han establecido una simbiosis con los programas destinados a mejorar, mantener y recuperar el medio ambiente. Por ese motivo La Fundación la Tortuga, ha sido uno de los aliados de OVETUDA en el desarrollo de campañas dirigidas a concienciar sobre el mantenimiento del medio ambiente, aprovechando para ello el Festival Acuático en la ciudad de Puerto La Cruz.<!--:--><!--:en-->Over the years, tourism and adventure sports activities have established a symbiosis with programs aimed at improving, maintaining, and recovering the environment. For this reason, La Tortuga Foundation has been one of OVETUDA’s allies in the development of campaigns aimed at raising awareness about the maintenance of the environment, taking advantage of the Aquatic Festival in the city of Puerto La Cruz.<!--:-->','821e084b-bc49-4961-ad1a-984b147d5954','Post','2022-01-27 23:10:05','2022-01-27 23:10:05'),('e20c77cd-19e7-4352-8da2-43e09c3c5ac6','slug','el-nuevo-rey-del-atlantico-pez-leon-llego-al-oriente-venezolano,the-new-king-of-the-atlantic-lionfish-arrived-in-eastern-venezuela','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('55c8f184-3763-4db3-83cc-64b55f2d0b44','summary','<!--:es-->El Pterois volitans, originario de los océanos Índico y Pacífico, se ha reproducido a gran velocidad en el Mar Caribe, y ha sido observado en 31 localidades del territorio nacional.  Falcón, Carabobo, Vargas, Miranda, Los Roques, Las Aves, Anzoátegui y Sucre ya han recibido la visita del peligroso depredador que podría alterar la economía y el turismo del país.<!--:--><!--:en-->The Pterois volitans, native to the Indian and Pacific Oceans, has reproduced at great speed in the Caribbean Sea, and has been observed in 31 localities of the national territory. Falcón, Carabobo, Vargas, Miranda, Los Roques, Las Aves, Anzoátegui, and Sucre have already been visited by dangerous predator that could alter the country’s economy and tourism.<!--:-->','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('e4d73438-c7c7-40b1-9953-f27c2203a840','template','','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('bfe8851a-9529-4ad8-a6ee-68911695ba9d','has_comments','1','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('1bf30b9c-1331-46fd-8bc5-8cd45aa5f095','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"label_eval\":\"\",\"panel_hidden\":\"\",\"default_value\":\"\",\"multiple\":\"0\",\"required\":\"0\",\"translate\":\"1\"}','bdef958a-c67f-48c1-ae5e-772aa8debcad','CustomField','2021-12-08 19:16:52','2021-12-14 22:54:24'),('3d646ba5-985d-41d9-9c63-99443f545bc6','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"label_eval\":\"\",\"panel_hidden\":\"\",\"default_value\":\"\",\"multiple\":\"0\",\"required\":\"0\",\"translate\":\"1\"}','ab3f25df-5b9b-445c-95e9-9687e5d87b5e','CustomField','2021-12-08 19:16:52','2021-12-14 22:54:24'),('711bb15b-2629-4560-be4e-ca144c8f6bb2','_default','{\"fi