9e486','Post','2022-04-15 17:58:24','2022-04-15 17:58:24'),('eb75cd39-21b2-4411-88ce-6d0ebb85a762','template','','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('8df17a49-cee4-47a0-bb8c-579c171f5162','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('4a8ad1d2-d83f-44fb-839e-826311fb5607','has_comments','1','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('0e37238e-c2db-4554-a510-42046e784199','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/waraos_JANOKO-YAKERA.jpg','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('1162215d-6496-4907-a272-1a2b136a7b3d','slug','un-paso-mas-en-el-proyecto-janoko-yakera,one-more-step-in-the-project-janoko-yakera','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('c07ea048-3cfc-4d91-870d-3e552876b14c','slug','conociendo-a-la-cotorra-margaritena,getting-to-know-the','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('7c92b019-9251-4572-ae49-14368b136b75','summary','<!--:es-->Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) visitó nuevamente el estado Delta Amacuro, para continuar con el intercambio cultural con la población Warao radicada en la zona. Durante la estadía, se realizó una expedición que permitió adelantar el proyecto “JANOKO YAKERA” que la comunidad Warao de El Moriche viene desarrollando con el apoyo de la FLT, iniciativa integrada por su cacique Abel Palacios, la coordinadora Maya.shita Palacios y la artesana Raquel Palacios.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) once again visited the state of Delta Amacuro to continue the cultural exchange with the Warao population living in the area. During the stay, an expedition was carried out to advance the \"JANOKO YAKERA\" project that the Warao community of El Moriche has been developing with the support of FLT, an initiative integrated by its cacique Abel Palacios, the coordinator Maya.shita Palacios and the artisan Raquel Palacios.<!--:-->','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('cbfad843-fcb6-4db9-8d73-cf1ec1265b88','slug','humedales-para-nuestro-futuro,wetlands-for-our-future','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:42','2022-01-28 01:44:42'),('0120b4ba-fb6d-4f45-9585-06a72ad15040','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','fabd92f9-0c67-4c58-8b79-97f5ab071d31','Post','2022-01-27 20:55:44','2022-01-27 20:55:44'),('8a9efcd3-4757-4ff0-94e9-a71982377654','has_comments','1','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-19 00:53:44'),('eef1d3ca-d19f-47f7-876b-b52c26ae815a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bolsas7.jpg','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-19 00:53:44'),('50cef69c-074e-4783-9eba-99202487d4dd','summary','<!--:es-->Una estupenda visita vivió Fundación La Tortuga con los amigos de Provita en la Península de Macanao y su proyecto de Conservación de la Cotorra Margariteña. Este exitoso trabajo se realiza en la Isla de Margarita desde el año 1989, donde con la comunidad se han desarrollado importantes aportes para la protección de estas especies tanto a nivel nacional como internacional.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación La Tortuga had a wonderful visit with Provita’s friends in the Macanao Peninsula and its Margarita Parakeet Conservation Project. This successful work has been carried out on Margarita Island since 1989, where the community has made important contributions to the protection of these species both nationally and internationally.<!--:-->','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('a882d533-4d6d-4278-85ba-9f66acb12bef','slug','rao-anzoategui-participa-en-congresos-ambientales,rao-anzoategui-participates-in-environmental-congresses','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('9395702a-1400-40b9-8cdc-ab4a2e2f0186','slug','preciosas-piezas-en-curso-de-orfebreria-con-hernan-coa,precious-pieces-in-goldsmith-course-with-hernan-coa','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('51111bc3-d68f-4dca-aae6-f4ce3e84c33f','template','','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('8740cb84-1ef7-450b-a954-653da2990469','has_comments','1','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('95ac24f6-6894-4979-a749-11b73b54ca41','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/cotorra8.jpg','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('d7431028-cd29-49b4-9490-b2cf403d3bf0','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','fee5abd6-ebf7-4c24-a92c-17c1ab1a432a','Post','2022-01-28 00:07:04','2022-01-28 00:07:04'),('ee3f39b7-1ca2-4cf0-a06d-26cf5b307b5d','summary','<!--:es-->Durante 30 horas de intenso trabajo, Hernán Coa dictó un curso básico de orfebrería en las instalaciones de Fundación La Tortuga.<!--:--><!--:en-->During 30 hours of intense work, Hernán Coa gave a basic goldsmith course at the facilities of Fundación La Tortuga.<!--:-->','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('02ffd046-650f-48f0-9fde-f65fb06d2558','template','','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('e054d7eb-995d-4815-897b-f00885f6ab8f','has_comments','1','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('581a6cf8-694b-420a-9764-29dc8de1936d','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/PreciosasPiezasEnCursoDeOrfebreriaConHernanCoa.jpg','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('070b8e66-1bd3-4fdd-9318-74f8c5650cb3','slug','nuevas-piezas-en-el-desfile-tortuguillo,new-pieces-in-the-parade-tortuguillo','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('fb361bb7-ab91-4dbc-94c0-421abede283e','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 3 de agosto se realizó en la Sede de Fundación La Tortuga el desfile “El Tortuguillo” con la asistencia de un nutrido grupo de asistentes y la espectacular pasarela a cargo de las modelos y bailarinas pertenecientes a la Academia de Modelaje Betty York.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, August 3, the parade \"El Tortuguillo\" was held at the headquarters of Fundación La Tortuga with the attendance of a large group of attendees and the spectacular catwalk by models and dancers belonging to the Betty York Modeling Academy.<!--:-->','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('c199a172-55f6-4b58-84d0-b1b29ce22928','summary','<!--:es-->Durante el primer semestre del año 2016, la empresa Petropiar ha cumplido una importante labor de sensibilización ambiental dirigida a sus empleados de manos de Fundación La Tortuga. <!--:--><!--:en-->During the first half of 2016, the company Petropiar has carried out important environmental awareness work aimed at its employees at the hands of Fundación La Tortuga.<!--:-->','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-29 00:11:41'),('7431866f-47df-4141-bedb-68c448bd642f','template','','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('cd93be69-0164-4b6f-afba-dbccab76ae9f','has_comments','1','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('45f393c5-f8b7-4ebc-8d1a-a75414492897','template','template_page','e74908e6-df77-4892-bd65-3db865b9e486','Post','2022-04-15 17:58:24','2022-04-15 17:58:24'),('be48bb29-1a85-40ff-b94f-75bd80fadbb1','slug','organizaciones-ambientalistas-y-gubernamentales-le-dijeron-no-al-arco-minero,environmental-and-government-organizations-said-no-to-the-mining-arch','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('8d54b862-f95e-4e95-a3b2-3d31194e5c58','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado jueves 30 de junio, se celebró en el Teatro \"Carlos Escarrá\" de PDVSA Guaraguao, el 1° Congreso Ecosocialista  presidido por la viceministra del MINEA, Siboney Tineo y el Gobernador del Estado Anzoátegui, Nelson Moreno y más de 35 organizaciones ambientalistas entre las que se destacaron: MAVEN, dirigida por Johan Paiva; INPARQUES, dirigido por Mariee Gil, el director de MINEA Anzoátegui Edgar Mata, MEVEN y FUNDACIÓN LA TORTUGA representada por Chelo Nogueira.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Thursday, June 30, the 1st Ecosocialist Congress was held at the \"Carlos Escarrá\" Theater of PDVSA Guaraguao, chaired by the Vice Minister of MINEA, Siboney Tineo, and the Governor of the Anzoátegui State, Nelson Moreno, and more than 35 environmental organizations, including those that stood out: MAVEN, directed by Johan Paiva; INPARQUES, directed by Mariee Gil, the director of MINEA Anzoátegui Edgar Mata, MEVEN and FUNDACIÓN LA TORTUGA represented by Chelo Nogueira.<!--:-->','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('b9b2e900-1874-4d12-b0c1-a5cbf0d60e94','template','','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('d3ff9e48-6007-497e-b44b-a699aac7e0a4','has_comments','1','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('3d5accfb-75b9-47b1-a2e1-d4842b09b1be','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ambientalistas-dijeron-no-al-arco-minero.jpg','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('a3c92a38-6ce2-4d95-a296-c8529cb34e32','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','bf5b92d3-41d7-4ac6-8247-f3a95d917d47','Post','2022-01-19 00:43:28','2022-01-19 00:43:28'),('d1dd344b-aaf5-4576-8752-da02b88bed21','template','','19cfaeef-608a-43b6-86f3-0cb5b81b2c52','Post','2022-01-19 12:43:45','2022-01-19 12:43:45'),('35849157-317c-40f9-929a-307fe8a6186a','avatar','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Gea.jpeg','503be8c2-1c8d-42bf-bee2-ef2f428cc8b0','User','2021-12-09 19:10:19','2021-12-16 00:37:29'),('00f2db43-5854-43eb-9e47-1517ba15b591','has_comments','1','19cfaeef-608a-43b6-86f3-0cb5b81b2c52','Post','2022-01-19 12:43:45','2022-01-19 12:43:45'),('dc77e109-033c-4611-92df-1aeb924289b0','slug','rao-anzoategui-llega-a-su-5to-aniversario,rao-anzoategui-llega-a-su-5to-aniversario-1','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:42:43'),('34ebd832-543f-4c66-83cf-37c8cafba830','slug','petropiar-estimula-la-sensibilizacion-ambiental-en-sus-empleados-1,petropiar-stimulates-environmental-awareness-in-its-employees','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-19 00:53:44'),('1fef567a-8a5b-47bf-9ef2-4991d2cfd085','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','63a129d8-cb79-43a2-a225-0c7e858e9714','Post','2022-01-19 00:53:44','2022-01-19 00:53:44'),('55a08b27-9c21-4c8b-bac3-ca7f5da5760e','summary','<!--:es-->La Red de Aviso Oportuno, RAO Anzoátegui cumplió en mayo, cinco años de trabajo investigativo y educacional de la mano con la conservación y protección de tortugas marinas en el estado Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->In May, the Anzoátegui Early Warning Network, RAO Anzoátegui, completed five years of investigative and educational work for the conservation and protection of sea turtles in the state of Anzoátegui.<!--:-->','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:42:43'),('316d662c-8191-4b90-830b-9458fe6e60c7','template','','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:42:43'),('18d0f1a9-3a3c-4326-8415-3f54173be1cb','has_comments','1','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:42:43'),('b383819f-1857-44c3-985d-a48c5b2df098','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:42:43'),('895d3482-ef49-4396-b1f2-db502b2ae4a4','slug','rao-anzoategui-llega-a-su-5to-aniversario,rao-anzoategui-llega-a-su-5to-aniversario-1','19cfaeef-608a-43b6-86f3-0cb5b81b2c52','Post','2022-01-19 12:43:45','2022-01-19 12:43:45'),('9c763233-fa7c-4315-a405-fc88ca618c00','summary','<!--:es-->La Red de Aviso Oportuno, RAO Anzoátegui cumplió en mayo, cinco años de trabajo investigativo y educacional de la mano con la conservación y protección de tortugas marinas en el estado Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->In May, the Anzoátegui Early Warning Network, RAO Anzoátegui, completed five years of investigative and educational work for the conservation and protection of sea turtles in the state of Anzoátegui.<!--:-->','19cfaeef-608a-43b6-86f3-0cb5b81b2c52','Post','2022-01-19 12:43:45','2022-01-19 12:43:45'),('8a70a8a0-d4bc-453b-b3d6-1f7c06a6c704','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/feb1.jpg','19cfaeef-608a-43b6-86f3-0cb5b81b2c52','Post','2022-01-19 12:43:45','2022-01-19 12:43:45'),('53b04be6-3be3-4f18-bcad-ae61b5b6b2ce','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/feb1.jpg','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-19 12:42:43','2022-01-19 12:43:46'),('5bc40d7c-2e80-442d-aba2-5e523f9871f8','slug','dia-de-la-tierra-2015,earth-day-2015','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('6a8405aa-fe02-451a-b7ea-e27604d02141','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','2d878f54-78fd-40a0-a122-dd95468437ce','Post','2022-01-29 01:11:11','2022-01-29 01:11:11'),('cf3388d0-45d7-4ce5-89fe-2c0f4d30cf14','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/NuevasPiezasEnElDesfileTortuguillo.jpg','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('c7aeb664-aa39-4853-942f-db5e831fa5cc','slug','ambientarrrt-cerro-ciclo-de-presentaciones-en-madrid,ambientarrrt-closed-cycle-of-presentations-in-madrid','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('fc7af144-d08a-4085-ac22-7022526171e8','summary','<!--:es-->Los espacios del Centro Cultural Matadero, en el Municipio de Arganzuela, mostraron, durante cinco días, un show cargado de originalidad, conformado por moda y ecología. Ambientarrrt es el nombre de este programa desarrollado por Fundación La Tortuga desde el año 2009, y que en esta oportunidad rompió fronteras y se trasladó a la capital de España, para exhibir fotografías, piezas de arte, performance y modelaje con mensajes conservacionistas.<!--:--><!--:en-->The spaces of the Matadero Cultural Center, in the municipality of Arganzuela, showed, for five days, a show full of originality, fashion, and ecology. Ambientarrrt is the name of this program developed by Fundación La Tortuga since 2009, which this time broke borders and moved to the capital of Spain, to exhibit photographs, art pieces, performance, and modeling with conservationist messages.<!--:-->','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('7a7bf37b-57c8-4714-87c5-414d5b65a2a5','template','','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('c1b558e4-a738-4482-a7b8-9e63ac467ab2','slug','actividades-importantes--para-celebrar-la-tierra,important-activities-to-celebrate-the-earth-1','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('2198162a-a151-44c8-a8a5-f27ed11cef77','summary','<!--:es-->Fundación La Tortuga llevó a cabo dos actividades ecológicas con motivo del Día Mundial de La Tierra 2016, cumpliendo así con uno de sus objetivos fundamentales: proteger y conservar a la naturaleza a través de la educación ambiental.<!--:--><!--:en-->La Tortuga Foundation carried out two ecological activities on the occasion of World Earth Day 2016, thus fulfilling one of its fundamental objectives: to protect and conserve nature through environmental education.<!--:-->','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('91a589e5-9d6b-4a42-a22e-89adfc4c162f','template','','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('7f0a1ba3-a9fc-474d-8d7f-870b50e447a3','has_comments','1','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('5b2236ff-d30c-452c-ba4a-df9043b5c813','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/katun-river-geb4a4e379_640.jpg','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('53018aad-d4c0-4bd3-a00d-e15426a234ea','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-19 13:42:48','2022-01-19 13:42:48'),('e4ebaf1d-7250-4cd6-a31a-88331ae0fa51','has_comments','1','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('082b6b3f-1da7-4dc6-bbad-a115d5779972','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/parte_de_la_coleccin_3r.jpg','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('75399e22-8504-4491-944f-581ced6d404b','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','a4178c29-deca-4f9c-9a81-40e3d6c4e959','Post','2022-01-27 21:02:49','2022-01-27 21:02:49'),('27166127-28da-4fc7-9052-ce2348798d7a','slug','jornada-de-saneamiento-con-el-henry-pittier,sanitation-day-with-the-henry-pittier-university-institute','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:57:00','2022-02-02 14:57:00'),('7e99e13b-5ed7-42a2-8241-4cf22615a516','thumb','','e74908e6-df77-4892-bd65-3db865b9e486','Post','2022-04-15 17:58:24','2022-04-15 17:58:24'),('0d38d803-afcf-4603-a1cb-6745a458a3c8','summary','<!--:es-->RAO Anzoátegui, el proyecto de investigación y educación con tortugas marinas de Fundación La Tortuga, participó en los dos últimos Congresos Ambientales realizados en el país, mostrando sus resultados de tres años de trabajo continuo.<!--:--><!--:en-->RAO Anzoátegui, the research, and education project with sea turtles of La Tortuga Foundation participated in the last two Environmental Congresses held in the country, showing the results of three years of continuous work.<!--:-->','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('086ae4d6-5ad3-46bb-91b7-1e1fb33d23a0','template','','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('bd0d3ed3-119a-4941-9dac-7a32130bfd83','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/congreso8.jpg','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('0457f847-6deb-429f-b680-0b4b4ecb4dab','slug','avistamiento-de-ballena-jorobada-en-el-pn-mochima,humpback-whale-sighting-in-mochima','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('b5308e2b-d263-409e-be46-efe9c35bba84','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','966eaf03-b5ee-47a9-92a3-2c2d2f2e86f7','Post','2022-01-28 00:00:25','2022-01-28 00:00:25'),('b1a59ba0-17e5-440a-a580-ba9db5c8ac34','slug','la-tortuga-cronica-de-un-ecodesastre-anunciado,la-tortuga-chronicle-of-an-announced-ecodisaster','941d7bb5-0a6c-43b3-a226-fffcd463a6e0','Post','2022-01-28 00:15:42','2022-01-28 00:15:42'),('152b1946-f721-4526-83e8-8db27da2e4ac','summary','<!--:es-->Un grupo de turistas que se dirigía desde las costas de Puerto La Cruz hacia las playas de la Isla Chimana Grande en el Parque Nacional Mochima, tuvieron la oportunidad de avistar una ballena jorobada (Megaptera novaengliae), quien deleitó con un espectáculo de “juegos” a 8 personas que estaban a bordo de un taxi-bote.<!--:--><!--:en-->A group of tourists heading from the coast of Puerto La Cruz to the beaches of Chimana Grande Island in Mochima National Park, had the opportunity to see a humpback whale (Megaptera novaengliae), who delighted 8 people aboard a taxi-boat with a show of \"games\".<!--:-->','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('d85b5b95-d810-4dae-bc96-099c910a6ee2','template','','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('00ea0d72-f666-417b-9ccc-cb16f45a8283','has_comments','1','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('7b6bb943-094b-488e-a395-761f8831d30f','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ballena-en-mochima-venezuela.jpg','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('888ef611-be28-48d6-9f50-f110c0d4907b','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-01-28 00:26:55','2022-01-28 00:26:55'),('737d65f5-013b-4696-9f0d-628b407b60f4','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pez_leon_vla.jpg','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('0aa1c284-851a-49a9-9c6a-6283a124a65a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','7195acc8-56d5-4c73-8a03-f7e3c9566bfa','Post','2022-01-28 00:33:17','2022-01-28 00:33:17'),('c865f755-bb6d-4497-b83a-f5ed5cf777f8','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','7f790f51-0ad9-4ecd-83ee-76231085b600','Post','2022-01-31 00:43:39','2022-01-31 00:43:39'),('bd7e376a-c6e4-4a21-8fe0-9e5fe57c3e64','template','','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('baeba6af-bd88-4760-869e-cca911ba53fa','summary','<!--:es-->Con \"La Tierra toma el Espacio Urbano\", se dio inicio al evento en honor al planeta el pasado 23 de abril en la Sede de Fundación La Tortuga. Un desfile de maniquíes vivientes que representaban cada elemento terrestre (tierra, agua, aire y fuego) desfiló por la Av. Américo Vespucio culminando el recorrido en las instalaciones de la fundación, donde eran esperadas por el público presente. Las modelos pertenecen a la agrupación de Danza Contemporánea \"Movimiento Alternativo\" de Guanta, Anzoátegui...<!--:--><!--:en-->With \"The Earth takes the Urban Space\", the event in honor of the planet began on April 23 at the headquarters of La Tortuga Foundation. A parade of living mannequins representing each terrestrial element (earth, water, air, and fire) paraded along Américo Vespucio Avenue, culminating the tour at the foundation’s facilities, where they were awaited by the theturtlefoundation present. The models belong to the Contemporary Dance Group \"Movimiento Alternativo\" from Guanta, Anzoátegui...<!--:-->','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('23f4a8e6-56a4-44ac-82ab-dc77b3bd5db9','has_comments','1','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('b8ed6f75-f5ee-4558-9f0d-94d9c8b2fc2a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tutoriales-de-formacion-ambiental.jpg','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('054a8706-3d78-4119-b054-1af23e69c034','slug','no-es-basura-son-materiales,its-not-garbage-its-materials','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-19 13:55:32'),('63463122-de94-4cb3-8794-968842009e23','summary','<!--:es-->Fundación la Tortuga  una vez más, cumpliendo con uno de los objetivos del programa de capacitación y sensibilización ambiental: “no es basura, son materiales”, llevó a cabo el proyecto  de  “Climatización de la Churuata de reuniones” en la Aldea de Pescadores de Lechería, aplicando las 3R ambientales y generando un cambio social, responsable e inteligente  con el ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación la Tortuga, once again complying with one of the objectives of the training and environmental awareness program: \"it’s not garbage, it’s materials\", carried out the project \"Climate control of the meeting hall\" in the Fishermen’s Village of Lechería, applying the 3Rs environmental and generating a social, responsible and intelligent change with the environment.<!--:-->','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-19 13:55:32'),('d22fa581-1f62-4d42-a445-7a0a7d2243bd','template','','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-19 13:55:32'),('20509c4f-3ccf-4f8b-b61b-c6f45658d25c','has_comments','1','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-19 13:55:32'),('626e0d17-d599-4e59-b718-f0e106032ade','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-19 13:55:32'),('ee976cd7-414d-4fcf-9032-3b1df38c1fba','template','','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('e68975c2-0fbf-4a2e-b467-60a96f8b1bbf','has_comments','1','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('f2fc72c4-4f6c-402c-87ec-a0744cd1d8e8','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tierra4.jpg','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('7cfa6a1e-07d2-455e-ad4c-2d76a10b4a12','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/aldea1.jpg','eadccea3-a908-4ac2-a160-fde3cb23cb3f','Post','2022-01-19 13:55:32','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('185a98aa-8e19-4b6a-8596-b23c46f292be','template','','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:06:52'),('119fe6d3-5120-438b-a978-2adb7bd1e342','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('0764aac3-a09b-4d4c-bbc9-5797eb1f3887','summary','<!--:es-->Preocupados por la salud de los océanos y su biodiversidad, Fundación La Tortuga dictó varias charlas de sensibilización en la búsqueda de aliviar a la preocupante extinción presente en nuestros  mares y representada en las tortugas marinas, sobrevivientes ancestrales de los mismos.<!--:--><!--:en-->Concerned about the health of the oceans and their biodiversity, La Tortuga Foundation gave several awareness talks in the search to alleviate the worrying extinction present in our seas and represented in the sea turtles, ancestral survivors of them.<!--:-->','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('d2542ffe-0744-4dfe-893f-ac42b2e75260','template','','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('9f2614c2-2726-4f77-aa34-9043e87173fe','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-estrena-tutoriales-1,la-tortuga-foundation-launched-tutorials','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('969f2953-5b60-40ea-b01a-9c1eaf75f735','summary','<!--:es-->Una nueva etapa en la formación ambiental ofrece Fundación La Tortuga, al colocar al alcance de todos, una serie de dinámicos tutoriales para elaborar accesorios y objetos utilitarios desde la perspectiva del reúso.<!--:--><!--:en-->La Tortuga Foundation is offering a new stage in environmental education by making available to everyone a series of dynamic tutorials on how to make accessories and utilitarian objects from the perspective of reuse.<!--:-->','de702581-bbd1-4dd0-a614-917c360aeb18','Post','2022-01-19 14:42:01','2022-01-19 14:42:01'),('6a43b5cf-ba0d-4405-868a-c4535909a290','has_comments','1','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('1c1e1b34-42de-4059-a6c5-c7c1c87d8185','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/waves-gb65b823ca_640.jpg','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('2e4b5b87-4950-409e-8c97-2d04bfa67ddc','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','7c636cc7-7760-4412-b6e7-1a71b77c60fc','Post','2022-01-19 16:22:26','2022-01-19 16:22:26'),('8d0be2a6-f196-4051-99cd-10ca7fa03fed','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','46c14192-a460-4dc8-9429-3e8a14bc8663','Post','2022-01-28 01:26:59','2022-01-28 01:26:59'),('e67f4d25-877b-4cad-8a9b-e847f13550be','slug','flt-lanzo-el-programa-adopta-una-tortuga,flt-launches-the-adopt-a-turtle-program','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('624a987b-dc3d-45db-a443-fce060ab8174','summary','<!--:es-->A través de una rueda de prensa, Fundación La Tortuga dio a conocer su plan de adopción de tortugas marinas en el que se busca proteger a estas especies marinas a través de su apadrinamiento. El proyecto se desarrollará en conjunto con el Grupo de Trabajo en Tortugas Marinas de Nueva Esparta (GTTM-NE) y  busca integrar a niños, jóvenes y adultos en eventos interactivos con la finalidad de financiar actividades de conservación.<!--:--><!--:en-->Through a press conference, Fundación La Tortuga announced its plan to adopt sea turtles in order to protect these marine species through their sponsorship. The project will be developed in conjunction with the Nueva Esparta Sea Turtle Working Group (GTTM-NE) and seeks to integrate children, youth, and adults in interactive events in order to finance conservation activities.<!--:-->','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('83bc3faf-5c27-4d0f-af26-14f668a3e39f','template','','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('3939ccbd-8e9f-4ef9-b4ce-c2d79980fa5e','has_comments','1','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('4eadef76-249b-493e-9067-2b12dc45a005','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/adopta_una_tortuga.jpg','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('f119225b-5e5f-44b4-a2d7-c07c6f0ffd8a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','ef68d350-e899-46ae-a130-c418f17d011e','Post','2022-01-28 00:42:29','2022-01-28 00:42:29'),('3c668f0f-8911-4c6e-aab1-2a878ec83b83','slug','las-tortugas-marinas-regresan-a-la-zona-donde-nacieron,sea-turtles-return-to-the-area-where-they-were-born','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:33','2022-01-31 17:48:33'),('0a42d6c0-bf8d-4b72-9d98-9e972081d0da','summary','<!--:es-->Durante el mes de julio, la RAO Anzoátegui realizó como de costumbre sus recorridos identificando la actividad de tortugas marinas en el estado Anzoátegui, pudiendo constatar la presencia de nidos de tortuga de Carey y Verde.<!--:--><!--:en-->During the month of July, RAO Anzoátegui carried out its usual tours identifying the activity of sea turtles in the state of Anzoátegui, and was able to confirm the presence of Hawksbill and Green turtle nests.<!--:-->','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:33','2022-01-31 17:48:33'),('cfa803b0-4597-45e7-b024-1ef8f1eedbb5','template','','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:33','2022-01-31 17:48:33'),('d260b9a2-b2d3-4f45-9ce6-1e74d9d22711','template','','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('ba71d8ee-9788-4342-adc5-52fe8dc382f5','has_comments','1','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('fa9db650-aea0-4b8f-b6a1-fe9d0f17770d','slug','eexposicion-vestigios-de-identidadxposicion-exposicioexposicion-vestigios-de-identidadn-vestigios-de-identidadvestigios-de-identidad,exhibition-vestiges-of-identity','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('5d440b1e-c5df-4d54-8322-77c554650e02','summary','<!--:es-->En la Sede de Fundación La Tortuga reposa para el deleite de grandes y chicos, parte de una muestra de piezas de cerámica y de gres pertenecientes a nuestro pasado histórico.<!--:--><!--:en-->At the headquarters of La Tortuga Foundation there is a sample of ceramic and stoneware pieces from our historical past, for the delight of young and old alike.<!--:-->','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('7986e87c-d323-4cf8-b5b7-6e140447072d','template','','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('34f0cf83-7cca-4a34-b820-2d42c0432794','has_comments','1','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('7b27e95a-a6e1-45bd-bd02-e0077cc9b628','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/arq7.jpg','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('079917db-e461-46c5-aaba-446ebe159489','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','1acf18a8-f2ed-4e7b-a971-2d8f5adefafe','Post','2022-01-28 01:33:31','2022-01-28 01:33:31'),('c2c54c14-43ab-4ca3-8c7d-9bc560accdf0','slug','dia-internacional-de-la-diversidad-biologica-2014,international-day-for-biological-diversity-2014','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('737da9db-6821-4d60-8222-461f814a511a','summary','<!--:es-->Cada 22 de mayo, por disposición de las Naciones Unidas, se celebra el Día de la Biodiversidad en el planeta para concienciar e informar a los Estados sobre la importancia de este tema. Este 2014 el tema elegido es “Diversidad Biológica de las Islas”...<!--:--><!--:en-->Every May 22, as mandated by the United Nations, Biodiversity Day is celebrated on the planet to raise awareness and inform States about the importance of this issue. This 2014 the chosen theme is \"Island Biodiversity\"....<!--:-->','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('dd347861-6765-486d-9dc2-801ec47ff722','visits','2631','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-02-01 16:46:16','2024-06-30 19:04:37'),('fe13e44c-e1b3-4515-b379-8981e8721154','visits','2595','96f1df40-f61e-4d02-8f65-b43b3c477267','Post','2022-01-20 06:43:24','2024-06-30 11:59:46'),('3d416d5a-68f4-42ec-b136-6452f18b63dd','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/idb-2014-logo-es.jpg','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('8e9b1144-423a-4189-ab30-cf1638e8cab4','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','2d141d13-eb98-4454-8167-446e0fb324b5','Post','2022-01-28 02:04:21','2022-01-28 02:04:21'),('d795fbe0-15f8-4757-8b43-2840527705bd','slug','aromas-y-sabores-fusionados-en-una-cata-de-te,aromas-and-flavors-fused-in-a-tea-tasting','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('2320031c-b6ad-43e2-86c4-cde848c74797','summary','<!--:es-->Texturas, aromas y sabores se fusionaron en una Cata de Té realizada el pasado sábado 30 de noviembre en la sede de Fundación La Tortuga en Lechería.<!--:--><!--:en-->Textures, aromas, and flavors merged in a Tea Tasting held last Saturday, November 30 at the headquarters of Fundación La Tortuga in Lechería.<!--:-->','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('0c26ac86-d2b4-4cda-8d69-42c62ad2c62f','template','','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('467ff8ee-fafa-491e-acb6-caf8cb3ad316','has_comments','1','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('3401e0a5-edc5-4580-8cb0-b55dd6a6ae01','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tee-g4ba6f210b_640.jpg','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('3422c32c-2d0e-4dfd-b0cf-79cf4d05bcca','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','89d218a6-abed-4445-b37b-f1e8e010e4d3','Post','2022-01-29 00:19:05','2022-01-29 00:19:05'),('b998dc61-1143-4967-9379-ab6d63ae6bc4','has_comments','1','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:34','2022-01-31 17:48:34'),('8b5fee65-5a30-43c8-bb14-133b2fdc8da9','slug','continua-monitoreo-de-los-canales-de-el-morro,continua-monitoreo-de-los-canales-de-el-morro-1','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('90c118c6-8bff-4895-b44f-e90592f53057','summary','<!--:es-->Dentro de las actividades preliminares de evaluación que viene desarrollando Fundación La Tortuga desde hace más de dos años en los canales de Lechería, paso previo para el desarrollo del proyecto de Evaluación de la Calidad del Agua de los Canales del Complejo Turístico El Morro<!--:--><!--:en-->As part of the preliminary evaluation activities that Fundación La Tortuga has been developing for more than two years in the canals of Lechería, a previous step for the development of the Water Quality Evaluation Project of the Canals of the El Morro Tourist Complex, a new field trip was made to relocate the positions of the stations that will be used for this monitoring, as well as to add others in areas that were not initially foreseen.<!--:-->','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('322de00c-79c5-4948-9652-a596a5d0b3a7','template','','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('15c4d0a1-536c-4637-81d1-3c95d03ff8b1','has_comments','1','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('9cc1f5c3-d734-4db9-b833-85f8e1b93a9a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/proy_evaluacion_canales.jpg','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('38157c0e-ee4d-46ae-aaea-d9b54de5c869','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','4bcfcf0f-ec3c-465d-b019-423980af129f','Post','2022-01-28 01:04:02','2022-01-28 01:04:02'),('6ad28b3a-0936-49a1-b1dd-339ddfb48854','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/turtle-gd1af4bb04_640.jpg','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:34','2022-01-31 17:48:34'),('eea8feed-0cc0-402c-ae08-8a7ed6122e77','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','cb7ca351-7125-4a0c-aac1-f43d73fc17b3','Post','2022-01-31 17:48:34','2022-01-31 17:48:34'),('5bb80fe0-7a5c-4570-983e-68a74cc3fa1c','template','','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:43','2022-01-28 01:44:43'),('ea409aad-e2ea-43b2-a354-38be290eece2','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','2f99e394-f9cf-4cbb-96b8-ff74783ac7ad','Post','2022-05-03 17:51:45','2022-05-03 17:51:45'),('48e535ae-3861-4b29-b9e8-dbabedf760d7','has_comments','1','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:43','2022-01-28 01:44:43'),('95205a48-b43b-476f-b49d-c2c23d14abb5','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-arriba-a-su-primera-decada,la-tortuga-foundation-celebrates-its-first-decade','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('cf3106e0-e695-4aa8-bea7-f16223ef9837','summary','<!--:es-->Un 17 de febrero del año 2005, esta organización nació legalmente para contribuir con la conservación y protección de la naturaleza, haciendo énfasis en los ecosistemas marino-costeros, zonas predilectas para desarrollar casi todos los proyectos que ha trabajado.<!--:--><!--:en-->On February 17, 2005, this organization was legally born to contribute to the conservation and protection of nature, with an emphasis on marine-coastal ecosystems, the preferred areas to develop almost all the projects it has worked on.<!--:-->','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('531bea53-68b0-42a6-8252-f00245e6dd03','template','','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('e229bdde-c9ba-4a11-9e66-50bd9d39e319','has_comments','1','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('fbf44749-ebdd-4208-ba2d-90b2a60e7453','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/decimo-aniversario-flt.jpg','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('29118901-9111-4837-b3be-38e9abf5b427','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','f302efeb-0355-4210-aa63-5402219ef8ba','Post','2022-01-28 01:38:00','2022-01-28 01:38:00'),('a17e3926-9ca4-494a-8d0a-df3407096632','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/dia-mundial-humedales-2015.jpg','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:43','2022-01-28 01:44:43'),('d02f6b03-6303-4a7b-a0d7-5d9b6f464ade','summary','<!--:es-->Cada 2 de febrero se celebra en el mundo el Día Mundial de Los Humedales, gracias al Tratado intergubernamental que se firmó en la ciudad de Ramsar (Irán) en 1971 y que proporciona el marco para la conservación y el uso racional de estas áreas naturales o no.<!--:--><!--:en-->Every February 2, World Wetlands Day is celebrated around the world, thanks to the Intergovernmental Treaty signed in the city of Ramsar (Iran) in 1971, which provides the framework for the conservation and wise use of these natural or non-natural areas.<!--:-->','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:43','2022-01-28 01:44:43'),('2d0d0611-c7f6-4919-8a10-3d6b84d513d8','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','b4755d7c-c66b-4320-9a90-4ecdae8ee531','Post','2022-01-28 01:44:43','2022-01-28 01:44:43'),('70d31a85-8936-4fff-8fae-f96e7f850ed2','slug','dia-mundial-de-las-aves-migratorias,world-migratory-bird-day','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('a21bc964-b1c3-4441-868b-34c29accf82b','template','','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('403009c1-a3e9-470f-b045-d2236ddc7b9d','has_comments','1','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('5f045047-80d0-4fb6-ab39-8dda422319db','summary','<!--:es-->Con el tema \"Destino Rutas Aéreas: Aves Migratorias y Turismo\", el Día Mundial de las Aves Migratorias (WMBD) 2014 destaca el vínculo entre la conservación de aves migratorias, el desarrollo de las comunidades locales y el turismo de observación de fauna silvestre en todo el mundo.<!--:--><!--:en-->With the theme \"Destination Flyways: Migratory Birds and Tourism\", World Migratory Bird Day (WMBD) 2014 highlights the link between migratory bird conservation, local community development and wildlife watching tourism worldwide.<!--:-->','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('4e491b31-1832-46f5-bc8c-2a5abcbc9821','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/dia_aves_migratorias.jpg','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('ddaaae1c-49f7-40a8-b66f-837e37c5117d','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','98cb4124-753a-4d34-b644-1f6c441cc241','Post','2022-01-28 02:09:50','2022-01-28 02:09:50'),('97ef0fdf-8fda-4799-9c09-2547d63cc5e1','slug','antropologia-en-fundacion-la-tortuga-1,anthropology-at-la-tortuga-foundation','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('3724d3e8-e38c-4dff-b081-ccff66246dd8','summary','<!--:es-->En el marco de las alianzas que Fundación La Tortuga busca establecer con los pueblos indígenas del Delta Amacuro y en su afán por lograr una mejor interacción con el medio y un mejor aprovechamiento de los recursos, en armonía con las comunidades autóctonas, Fundación La Tortuga recibió en su sede al antropólogo Ronny Velásquez.<!--:--><!--:en-->Within the framework of the alliances that La Tortuga Foundation seeks to establish with the indigenous peoples of the Delta Amacuro and in its desire to achieve a better interaction with the environment and better use of resources, in harmony with the indigenous communities, La Tortuga Foundation received at its headquarters the anthropologist Ronny Velásquez.<!--:-->','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('b2d9589a-0f4c-4f4f-ac97-eb3fdd5a7b02','template','','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('c35fe6e5-6348-4b0b-8a72-49ab794b1aca','has_comments','1','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('ae6bdb21-5ce5-4370-a60a-06a4589b0d6f','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/antropologia-en-flt.jpg','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('f4276528-42a6-4c5f-b69c-7ec1310bac37','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','b5466943-a2d6-40f9-85bf-1c47fcc909fc','Post','2022-01-28 01:10:32','2022-01-28 01:10:32'),('feb97a7a-34ae-4c94-80a9-ebb1a24f480d','slug','culminan-eco-talleres-por-la-tierra,eco-workshops-for-the-earth-come-to-an-end','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('70cc6ab6-215d-4a28-bbef-62eb87ee7ded','summary','<!--:es-->Con una sonrisa de satisfacción y la entrega de sus certificados, los participantes de los Eco-Talleres que organizó Fundación La Tortuga expresaron su satisfacción por estas actividades.<!--:--><!--:en-->With a smile of satisfaction and the presentation of their certificates, the participants of the Eco-Workshops organized by Fundación La Tortuga expressed their satisfaction with these activities.<!--:-->','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('b0594a5f-0362-4059-bac6-4cc8a8f7dda9','template','','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('e90f06bb-9ada-47c1-9753-de2f5f2b67c5','has_comments','1','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('d1113d9f-aad3-48c3-9db6-944949576657','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/recycle-ga14f57add_640.jpg','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('8c43c02a-37f8-43d6-b017-314cda58456a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','82e44910-438e-41fb-b1b7-42298ba1c94d','Post','2022-01-31 00:53:23','2022-01-31 00:53:23'),('4e2b4ce3-1e47-45d0-b9ee-60cbb99d0d1a','slug','estudiantes-realizaron-caminata-a-beneficio-de-fundacion-la-tortuga,students-held-a-walk-to-benefit-la-tortuga-foundation','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('e5dc5b1c-275b-425d-b1ac-f3cd0b3d99ea','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado, 02 de agosto, la conservación ambiental adquirió una nueva forma cuando estudiantes del décimo semestre de Comunicación Social de la Universidad Santa María Núcleo Oriente, conjugaron la ecología con el deporte para realizar la I Caminata Proambiental, a beneficio de Fundación La Tortuga.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, August 2nd, environmental conservation acquired a new form when students of the tenth semester of Social Communication of the Universidad Santa María Núcleo Oriente, combined ecology with sports to carry out the I Pro-environmental Walk, in benefit of La Tortuga Foundation.<!--:-->','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('549068bd-71ed-4d24-980a-9450599dad07','template','','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('ea32a337-30b4-4c57-8bf7-d12a44f658d9','has_comments','1','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('fd1aa320-7a58-4b5d-be45-26d9152efa4b','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/caminata_proambiental.jpg','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('d06cf371-974b-4b40-aea4-7c785a5ea7d3','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','a8afda26-7d46-4514-bc7d-09271db68dfb','Post','2022-01-28 02:15:55','2022-01-28 02:15:55'),('705eed08-1f03-4b0c-9c5c-570cf490c5d4','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-con-la-sicologia-ambiental,la-tortuga-foundation-with-environmental-psychology','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('3986c625-8173-4100-86bf-3de05e9fe19e','summary','<!--:es-->Para ampliar el radio de acción positiva que desarrolla Fundación La Tortuga, llega a su equipo la Dra. Lisbeth Bethelmy.<!--:--><!--:en-->Dr. Lisbeth Bethelmy has joined Fundación La Tortuga’s team to expand the radius of positive action developed by La Tortuga Foundation.<!--:-->','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('28afe4f9-916b-45d3-bf61-424d805a4769','template','','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('e5d90d10-e47c-4f8e-87d0-677adffac892','has_comments','1','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('fadf29d0-201a-49ed-a4b0-3e5cd6350b2a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Dra._Lisbeth_Bethelmy.jpg','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-01-29 00:32:18','2022-01-29 00:32:18'),('8a7ce1b7-35aa-486e-a115-40b680d7d20b','slug','creatividad-reino-en-evento-ambientarrrt-2010,creativity-reigned-in-ambientarrrt-2010-event','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('d6ad73fa-8be8-4487-a9b3-927f21d700eb','template','','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('cc3ab0c2-f449-4ea5-9a50-249e781edf32','summary','<!--:es-->Con el lema: TODOS SOMOS UNO, Juventudes de las Naciones Unidas de Venezuela celebraron en la ciudad de Maracay, estado Aragua, un  magno encuentro por la “Ecología y la Paz”  en su XII aniversario.<!--:--><!--:en-->With the slogan: WE ARE ALL ONE, the United Nations Youth of Venezuela celebrated in the city of Maracay, Aragua State, a great meeting for \"Ecology and Peace\" on its XII anniversary.<!--:-->','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('d02450b8-9f4a-4b5f-b10c-be191d38a797','template','','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('2a2fa99e-c9f9-4f3e-9359-6aeb62cd9a81','has_comments','1','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('365e0a71-da7c-44ff-9b93-c48c3f3b19f5','slug','juventudes-por-un-nuevo-planeta,youth-for-a-new-planet','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('cd33f858-d070-4223-b658-a3b79bc912a1','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/friends-g9bf873c2d_640.jpg','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('21f121b6-8eb6-4880-865d-82b9a7ec009c','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','b722ea54-b51d-4eb1-809b-a8f7dbd81ac2','Post','2022-01-29 01:56:07','2022-01-29 01:56:07'),('3840df21-067a-4455-b809-c98efa995fc8','slug','dia-mundial-de-la-tierra-jornada-de-diversion-y-reflexion,world-earth-day-a-day-of-fun-and-reflection','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('8af1de30-fd43-4047-862f-768c1a9c4fad','summary','<!--:es-->El domingo 22 de abril en la Plaza Central del Centro Comercial Plaza Mayor,  Fundación La Tortuga hizo su presentación del programa “Objetivo Tierra 2012” en donde grandes y chicos pudieron disfrutar de los fabulosos libros ejecutados por los niños de la Unidad Educativa José Ángel Montero, realizados con diversos materiales: unos de reúso (tapas, latas, plásticos…), otros de elementos extraídos directamente de la naturaleza (conchas de pistacho, flores, hojas, ramas…) a través de los cuales nos llevaron por diversas manifestaciones de la naturaleza, pájaros, árboles, mariposas, etc.<!--:--><!--:en-->On Sunday, April 22nd at the Central Plaza of the Plaza Mayor Shopping Center, La Tortuga Foundation presented the program \"Objective Earth 2012\" where children and adults could enjoy the fabulous books made by the children of the José Ángel Montero Educational Unit, made with different materials: some from reuse (lids, cans, plastics...), others from elements extracted directly from nature (pistachio shells, flowers, leaves, branches...) through which they took us through diverse manifestations of nature, birds, trees, butterflies, etc.<!--:-->','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('83255aee-3a2b-4846-84fa-8cf43e7fd783','template','','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('3e3ed0f9-a388-4685-be67-4c7cc7ec2cff','has_comments','1','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('ed202cac-fb57-4ba5-9562-8b028901237f','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/children-g4cad9ee05_640.jpg','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('a4043199-4b91-41df-9b51-7d49f5cb95fb','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','e57ea4bb-3d96-49d2-8d62-9955e35dd298','Post','2022-01-29 00:43:48','2022-01-29 00:43:48'),('ea9b614b-4052-4eca-a9cb-83c6872222f9','slug','eco-recreo-la-tortuga-cerro-con-obra-de-teatro,eco-recreo-la-tortuga-closed-with-a-theater-play','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:36','2022-01-31 01:01:36'),('c1c3dcbb-decd-4311-9889-295c2a2dae75','summary','<!--:es-->Eco-Recreo La Tortuga, el plan vacacional de Fundación La Tortuga terminó sus dos semanas de actividad con una obra de teatro sobre la Madre Naturaleza y el Arcoíris. Desde el 6 y hasta el 17 de agosto se llevó a cabo este evento como es costumbre desde hace dos años, al que fueron invitados todos los niños a disfrutar de una serie de actividades que buscan afianzar los valores de respeto hacia el entorno, responsabilidad de las acciones diarias y esparcimiento sano.<!--:--><!--:en-->Eco-Recreo La Tortuga, Fundación La Tortuga’s vacation plan, ended its two weeks of activity with a play about Mother Nature and the Rainbow. This event was held from August 6 to 17, as has been the custom for the past two years, and all children were invited to enjoy a series of activities that seek to reinforce the values of respect for the environment, responsibility for daily actions, and healthy recreation.<!--:-->','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:36','2022-01-31 01:01:36'),('663ddb28-cd8a-4aa2-b3ca-201057f92505','template','','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:36','2022-01-31 01:01:36'),('dad56ad0-5dd8-4b5c-bdf1-ec681727e826','has_comments','1','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:36','2022-01-31 01:01:36'),('9644fff5-1849-42c4-ae9f-c5798cc2af6a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/theater-stage-ge9ecb7932_640.jpg','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:36','2022-01-31 01:01:36'),('6b38218c-2367-4941-aa0d-c2a52c318895','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','a9f301a8-2f4f-4b50-9622-8f38f6843ac2','Post','2022-01-31 01:01:37','2022-01-31 01:01:37'),('5ce23250-5cd0-48b6-b294-279c934ae3db','has_comments','1','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:06:52'),('872731b6-765b-4496-812c-69e2c6d5d6d2','slug','proyeccion-tribal-en-la-sede-de-fundacion-la-tortuga,tribal-screening-at-the-headquarters-of-fundacion-la-tortuga','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:06:52'),('0f3b9093-b406-4c77-b99c-065fe8b00af9','summary','<!--:es-->Conciencia ecológica, danza, gastronomía y alianzas. Con la finalidad de brindar un fin de semana diferente, Fundación La Tortuga abrió sus puertas al público para presentar “Proyección Tribal”, evento que tuvo lugar durante todo el fin de semana con bailes libres, yoga, bazar tribalero y ecológico, danza tribal étnica y fusionada, clases de danza, performance y música Balkanica en vivo con la Agrupación Carakaos.<!--:--><!--:en-->Ecological awareness, dance, gastronomy and alliances. In order to provide a different weekend, La Tortuga Foundation opened its doors to the theturtlefoundation to present \"Tribal Projection\", an event that took place throughout the weekend with free dances, yoga, tribal and ecological bazaar, ethnic and fusion tribal dance, dance classes, performance and live Balkan music with the Carakaos Group.<!--:-->','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:06:52'),('aea827a7-a909-42f3-8c65-0fb8cac0999d','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:06:52'),('ea45e3d9-e61e-41c3-943d-824d864c7719','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tree-g837737d62_640.jpg','0ce5c7bb-7b58-43ec-98b0-8f46bb75b559','Post','2022-01-31 01:06:52','2022-01-31 01:15:46'),('862a21fe-89ed-4111-80fb-f6524a6c20db','has_comments','1','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('fbb83bb5-7cf1-4ebd-a9c9-3d428949a6a6','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ambientarrrt-evento2010.jpg','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('f7e87347-0647-47b4-ba75-e59f187cdffe','slug','playas-1,mensaje-desde-la-playa','ee9ff248-790a-41aa-bd1a-448b2b21f40c','Post','2022-02-13 01:33:05','2022-02-13 01:33:05'),('b39f4215-9206-47a1-a6fe-4caf4587ff7c','summary','<!--:es-->Mucho se ha dicho acerca de los graves problemas que arremeten en contra del medio ambiente, por lo que Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) difunde parte de las posibles soluciones de una forma original. El programa Ambientarrrt  transmite las ideas de conservación a través del performance, la moda, el video y la música y en su edición 2010 se trasladó a Caracas para ofrecer un sencillo show cargado de creatividad y diversión.<!--:--><!--:en-->Much has been said about the serious problems that threaten the environment, so Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) spreads part of the possible solutions in an original way. The Ambientarrrt program transmits conservation ideas through performance, fashion, video, and music and in its 2010 edition moved to Caracas to offer a simple show full of creativity and fun.<!--:-->','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('81d5421a-5b71-4a6a-87e4-6db02ebde210','template','','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('8464f489-a3b2-4c99-86cc-213240f630c0','has_comments','1','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('8888bf5d-831a-4e5d-b107-a6654cf9cc79','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ambientarrrt-caracas.jpg','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('266ed46b-4242-4cf1-aace-8ce83ff0e573','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','dcde94cf-df9c-4417-ac6d-c7590b61be86','Post','2022-01-31 01:36:54','2022-01-31 01:36:54'),('51d9504f-b15c-4a8a-a9f4-fc13aceacbb1','slug','proyeccion-tribal-en-la-sede-de-fundacion-la-tortuga,tribal-screening-at-the-headquarters-of-fundacion-la-tortuga','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:08:32','2022-01-31 01:08:32'),('fef72ce4-b50e-4661-b2f3-74b2408291a2','slug','las-3-erres-en-la-ue-dr-julio-camejo,the-3-erres-at-ue-dr-julio-camejo','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('4eae29e0-60c9-411a-875b-d6b7ed28be57','summary','<!--:es-->Durante todo el día 5 de noviembre, la U.E. Dr. Julio Camejo en Barrio Corea de Barcelona, recibió la visita de Fundación La Tortuga y la empresa Domotica de Venezuela para afianzar los conocimientos sobre el tema de conservación, una vez cumplidos los lineamientos del Colectivo Estadal de Gestión Ambiental del Minamb.<!--:--><!--:en-->Throughout November 5, the U.E. Dr. Julio Camejo in Barrio Corea in Barcelona, received a visit from Fundación La Tortuga and the company Domotica de Venezuela to reinforce knowledge on the subject of conservation, once the guidelines of the State Collective of Environmental Management of the Minamb had been fulfilled.<!--:-->','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('3e0b9e26-5ab9-4ebf-b499-52c103760106','template','','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('f525e43b-d8fa-4073-afda-83f1326e355f','has_comments','1','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('b2724268-1696-4f77-b441-4d60a4ae6680','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Las3ERRESEnLaUEDrJulioCamejo.jpg','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('728954c5-ab41-4b55-8a5c-b8af711c3d6f','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','23941e8e-e28d-49e0-bf2f-b0bcd3ac0c12','Post','2022-01-29 01:28:03','2022-01-29 01:28:03'),('ce23ea2c-b53d-4e21-b66c-58a168c905d3','template','','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:35:18','2022-01-29 01:35:18'),('244540fc-b33f-46ab-99f9-9abb5106320a','has_comments','1','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:35:18','2022-01-29 01:35:18'),('ba11fc96-5128-43ad-8ded-5eff9a7dc040','summary','<!--:es-->Conciencia ecológica, danza, gastronomía y alianzas. Con la finalidad de brindar un fin de semana diferente, Fundación La Tortuga abrió sus puertas al público para presentar “Proyección Tribal”, evento que tuvo lugar durante todo el fin de semana con bailes libres, yoga, bazar tribalero y ecológico, danza tribal étnica y fusionada, clases de danza, performance y música Balkanica en vivo con la Agrupación Carakaos.<!--:--><!--:en-->Ecological awareness, dance, gastronomy and alliances. In order to provide a different weekend, La Tortuga Foundation opened its doors to the theturtlefoundation to present \"Tribal Projection\", an event that took place throughout the weekend with free dances, yoga, tribal and ecological bazaar, ethnic and fusion tribal dance, dance classes, performance and live Balkan music with the Carakaos Group.<!--:-->','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:08:32','2022-01-31 01:08:32'),('a892331d-2baa-40f3-9ed9-1506a487d8bf','summary','<!--:es-->No importa a cual cultura se pertenezca, tampoco el lugar de origen, ni las distancias que nos separen, esas simples referencias pasan a un segundo plano cuando el legítimo deseo de ayudar y contribuir efectivamente al bienestar de la colectividad y su entorno se manifiestan en el corazón de la gente y sus latidos retumban en la Tierra.<!--:--><!--:en-->It does not matter to which culture one belongs, nor the place of origin, nor the distances that separate us, those simple references pass to a second plane when the legitimate desire to help and contribute effectively to the welfare of the community and its environment are manifested in the hearts of the people and their heartbeats echo in the Earth.<!--:-->','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:35:18','2022-01-29 01:36:18'),('cbc98ff4-26a8-4387-9247-f19d965a44f4','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:36:18','2022-01-29 01:36:18'),('e1bcee40-92b8-4892-a38f-29a8878f843a','slug','entrega-de-donativo-a-comunidad-warao,donation-delivery-to-warao-community','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:35:18','2022-01-29 01:37:18'),('7f83470b-ec4b-4e29-8228-13acf68c4624','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/EntregaDeDonativoAComunidadWarao.jpg','01fb0f30-5809-480d-9905-6314f7205b2e','Post','2022-01-29 01:35:18','2022-01-29 01:38:17'),('c6a1ec60-1c1d-474f-a238-2f3b139cbdb7','template','','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:08:32','2022-01-31 01:08:32'),('24a845a0-7fbe-4796-911f-0e5957541d19','has_comments','1','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:08:32','2022-01-31 01:08:32'),('ef3616d4-a312-46ea-a067-d77bf8994c9f','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:09:33','2022-01-31 01:09:33'),('4ba56590-e872-4995-b27b-32bf49bc7598','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tree-g837737d62_640.jpg','b664532a-60d0-4868-971a-acf6638050a6','Post','2022-01-31 01:08:32','2022-01-31 01:15:30'),('53012154-ecb4-4a1f-8954-d0aa5b2a3b57','visits','343','1b6dbda2-de37-4564-994d-9fec96aad9e2','Post','2021-12-13 18:55:39','2022-05-02 16:55:41'),('a66fb9dd-d3fc-4d3d-9d60-63cbcef1aae5','slug','charla-en-la-sede-del-consejo-de-pescadores--de-choroni,charla-en-la-sede-del-consejo-de-pescadores--de-choroni-1','376f2668-0254-4ad5-93c2-398595b7da67','Post','2022-02-09 23:40:01','2022-02-09 23:40:01'),('df6fd88b-8ac3-4ac4-93e0-09d684b9951e','summary','<!--:es--><!--:--><!--:en-->La Tortuga Foundation (FLT) through its Ambientarrrt program celebrated Earth Day with a small show where creativity reigned. Despite power failures that delayed the activity scheduled at the Dimitrios Demu Museum, the event took place under an ecological environment and carried the conservationist message that is the north of this Non-Governmental Organization.<!--:-->','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('28c249b8-235b-4205-9d2a-9a67a23a7e1f','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','c334f6cf-698a-4771-b7d2-fbeda7d2f4af','Post','2022-01-31 01:43:20','2022-01-31 01:43:20'),('2b976518-1468-486a-95b7-536d73b92ee5','slug','rao-anzoategui-recibe-varios-reportes-de-varamientos-de-tortugas,rao-anzoategui-receives-several-reports-of-turtle-strandings','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('97f6b270-9f5f-4952-9ec9-ca7e8fce27c9','slug','las-redes-fantasma-un-asesino-silencioso,ghost-nets-a-silent-killer','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('bd844ba5-2723-4627-a80a-4690e1b398b1','slug','entrega-de-donativo-a-comunidad-warao-1,donation-delivery-to-warao-community-1','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('aebd075a-8b24-4375-8668-fa8e7a128fca','summary','<!--:es-->No importa a cual cultura se pertenezca, tampoco el lugar de origen, ni las distancias que nos separen, esas simples referencias pasan a un segundo plano cuando el legítimo deseo de ayudar y contribuir efectivamente al bienestar de la colectividad y su entorno se manifiestan en el corazón de la gente y sus latidos retumban en la Tierra.<!--:--><!--:en-->It does not matter to which culture one belongs, nor the place of origin, nor the distances that separate us, those simple references pass to a second plane when the legitimate desire to help and contribute effectively to the welfare of the community and its environment are manifested in the hearts of the people and their heartbeats echo in the Earth.<!--:-->','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('e876ab99-778e-4799-8988-d9f7af97a17f','template','','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('f89dc6cd-4d80-4ec6-94f6-191481e4fb69','has_comments','1','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('1cc242a7-493d-443f-bac1-a22f3a20f9e9','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/EntregaDeDonativoAComunidadWarao.jpg','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('83fd2cc3-582a-4348-bddf-662f3a27a6a1','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-01-29 01:44:29','2022-01-29 01:44:29'),('47cdbdc3-7efc-48a7-bb80-ab225216d533','template','','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('af7a9ed5-7184-44a7-b45f-7df36ad84033','has_comments','1','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('c8209570-13f4-43ff-872c-72c363ecf65f','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/recycle-g51450defe_640.jpg','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('430832ed-f0c4-4f98-b065-8560170c25ec','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('85c96236-b9ae-4e08-82b6-88fb9ae7f771','slug','una-danza-por-el-planeta,a-dance-for-the-planet','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('eaf636ee-33e7-426a-89f1-b871f6689714','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado jueves, Fundación La Tortuga realizó un evento en la plaza Rolando, frente a la mirada silenciosa del teatro Cajigal que se encuentra en fase de restauración. La actividad se inició con un taller de reciclaje impartido por el profesor Manuel Yepez, instructor dedicado a darle vida a un sin fin de objetos hechos con materiales de reciclaje, acompañado en ésta oportunidad por Mayrelis Palacios, Yosetlyn Palomo y Maigualida Suarez.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Thursday, Fundación La Tortuga held an event in Rolando Square, in front of the silent gaze of the Cajigal Theater, which is currently under restoration. The activity began with a recycling workshop given by Professor Manuel Yepez, an instructor dedicated to giving life to an endless number of objects made from recycled materials, accompanied on this occasion by Mayrelis Palacios, Yosetlyn Palomo, and Maigualida Suarez.<!--:-->','6d407089-51ed-46cd-852b-71beb666dd3c','Post','2022-01-31 01:26:38','2022-01-31 01:26:38'),('c8aeef98-ed97-4f52-ac0c-4b48a240e212','has_comments','1','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('10413462-9e98-4536-a57c-80796ab39eb0','slug','flt-dicto-charla-conservacionista-en-delta-amacuro,flt-gave-conservationist-talk-in-delta-amacuro','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('29b1af05-07cb-424f-bd72-15c42cd2ffea','summary','<!--:es-->Recientemente, Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) visitó el estado Delta Amacuro para llevar a cabo una actividad educacional e informativa sobre el agua. La Organización No Gubernamental (ONG) ofreció una charla a los estudiantes del Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Dr. “Delfín Mendoza”, en Tucupita, en la que el recurso hídrico y las dificultades que enfrenta fueron el foco principal.<!--:--><!--:en-->Recently, Fundación La Tortuga (FLT) visited the state of Delta Amacuro to carry out an educational and informative activity on water. The Non-Governmental Organization (NGO) gave a talk to students of the Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Dr. \"Delfín Mendoza\", in Tucupita, in which the water resource and the difficulties it faces were the main focus.<!--:-->','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('f060988a-e2f8-48e6-894c-e2fd8c9653f7','template','','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('e14abe3e-bb5e-48e0-a557-20cf56e60a25','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/charla-flt-delta-waraos.jpg','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('c4ab214e-2b20-4598-853c-bc137bbe7d84','slug','playas-1,mensaje-desde-la-playa','a641fd29-11fb-4099-b8c2-2c98949255f3','Post','2022-02-13 01:31:33','2022-02-13 01:31:33'),('200405f8-4705-42c7-b402-d08f62bf62a4','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-01-31 01:51:11','2022-01-31 01:51:11'),('e728b89f-6227-40f9-937a-7a38a2b5570a','template','','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('a6ce7636-01d1-4c4c-a26b-ffb64e2ad596','slug','el-tamano-de-las-tortugas-marinas-es-lo-mas-llamativo,the-size-of-the-sea-turtles-is-the-most-striking-thing-about-them','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('cb190f42-f3f2-4175-a899-df6b4a6cc242','summary','<!--:es-->Los niños y niñas de la UE Inés María de Potentini ubicada en el sector Tierra Adentro de Puerto La Cruz, recibieron la visita de Fundación La Tortuga el pasado 15 de julio para recibir una charla educativa sobre Tortugas Marinas.<!--:--><!--:en-->The children of UE Inés María de Potentini, located in the Tierra Adentro sector of Puerto La Cruz, received a visit from La Tortuga Foundation on July 15 to receive an educational talk about sea turtles.<!--:-->','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('ea46e2ee-b89c-4d80-8d8c-bbd3e146e60c','has_comments','1','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('91d8e064-88ee-459a-a59c-b16f4a11b1c6','template','template_page','376f2668-0254-4ad5-93c2-398595b7da67','Post','2022-02-09 23:40:01','2023-10-21 21:37:29'),('76b3a899-d666-4e75-80ef-2ca2c19b970f','visits','2206','c8c14164-0d99-4010-81ba-b49267f294f8','Post','2022-02-06 10:25:28','2024-06-30 13:24:15'),('bc775539-8685-4e66-aee1-51e757cd1780','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/sea-turtle-gba4a027b3_640.jpg','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('fb8f68f1-607f-49eb-bfaf-9545aac0b73f','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','fa646efb-1aee-4b2a-a066-e4b194058fc6','Post','2022-01-31 16:48:18','2022-01-31 16:48:18'),('faa89071-c103-4d86-8b68-c82af1392603','layout','','376f2668-0254-4ad5-93c2-398595b7da67','Post','2022-02-09 23:40:01','2022-02-09 23:40:01'),('c3fc6904-2a7f-460f-8837-b71b2926bf32','summary','<!--:es-->Respondiendo a la invitación que dispensara la Dra. Gisela Salazar y el Oficial Jesús Suárez de la Capitanía de Puerto de Puerto La Cruz, Fundación La Tortuga dictó charla sobre las tortugas marinas en la U.E. Matilde Salazar de Puerto La Cruz a los alumnos del 5to y 6to grado.<!--:--><!--:en-->Responding to an invitation from Dr. Gisela Salazar and Officer Jesús Suárez of the Port Captaincy of Puerto La Cruz, La Tortuga Foundation gave a talk on sea turtles at the Matilde Salazar School of Puerto La Cruz to 5th and 6th grade students.<!--:-->','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('2ec2f9ea-e3dd-4cb8-ae94-971923a0c3fe','template','','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('82ce88b0-ddc5-40d8-bf22-6b1a0755efd5','slug','el-oceano-es-el-protagonista-para-rao-anzoategui,the-ocean-is-the-protagonist-for-rao-anzoategui-1','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('43589614-3e73-40bf-8080-20be04f35f4f','has_comments','1','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('7cdd96f0-c657-4c43-9668-ef3ddac44f05','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/water-g71bff2fef_640.jpg','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('ea6d2179-1d11-411e-af05-f4fd99994169','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','1384b165-c735-4a39-98b8-efe34d6c7c5a','Post','2022-01-31 17:55:17','2022-01-31 17:55:17'),('f8043524-362f-4798-8427-20ce259b2948','visits','1','45e5cc80-84d2-4c59-9072-8f6a593604a2','Post','2022-04-18 15:51:02','2022-04-18 15:51:02'),('b4bcf58f-187a-4d31-8d5c-898c9e5066cd','slug','intercambio-cultural-con-los-waraos,cultural-exchange-with-the-waraos','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('44bbe36d-9287-4fc5-b367-c8d7a0d38e4e','summary','<!--:es-->La población Warao y la Fundación La Tortuga afianzaron el proyecto de apoyo e interacción entre ambas culturas, en el que las comunidades indígenas que habitan Delta Amacuro continuarán recibiendo información y guía especializada de la fundación y a la vez darán cátedra de sus conocimientos para procurar el mayor aprovechamiento de los desechos. El objetivo de la alianza es optimizar el impacto que está sufriendo el ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->The Warao population and the La Tortuga Foundation strengthened the support and interaction project between both cultures, in which the indigenous communities that inhabit Delta Amacuro will continue to receive information and specialized guidance from the foundation and at the same time will teach their knowledge in order to make the best use of waste. The objective of the alliance is to optimize the impact on the environment.<!--:-->','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('8711c2de-0eba-4bb4-a315-4e8358651a8e','template','','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('1f832b38-d8a5-4edb-b28d-a069694e4043','has_comments','1','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('ed7ccc9f-82c5-4af0-9f4b-f7035cbe34ac','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/intercambio-cultural-con-waraos.jpg','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('cb70135a-0667-42cc-b0d3-82366730a23e','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','3e48f7e7-a59c-4def-bea6-a2e8a4de33e6','Post','2022-01-31 01:58:12','2022-01-31 01:58:12'),('e6f355b6-6631-47c9-87f5-438d021901e9','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('ebfc49cf-9bcc-449a-bda8-87c54fc41be1','slug','jornada-de-saneamiento-con-el-henry-pittier,sanitation-day-with-the-henry-pittier-university-institute','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:51','2022-02-01 02:37:51'),('bc92ef43-05a1-4d36-ab86-d55babd1c3cb','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-se-vistio-de-moda-ecologica-en-ambientarrrt,la-tortuga-foundation-dressed-up-in-eco-fashion-at-ambientarrrt-1','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('bbef0ca8-d208-47ce-b597-c0c444b65837','summary','<!--:es-->Lechería.- La noche del pasado jueves, 12 de noviembre, Fundación La Tortuga presentó en su sede principal su última iniciativa: Ambientarrrt, atractiva propuesta que conjuga moda y ecología, de la mano de diseñadores altamente sensibilizados con la problemática ambiental que afronta el planeta.<!--:--><!--:en-->Lechería - Last Thursday night, November 12, Fundación La Tortuga presented at its headquarters its latest initiative: Ambientarrrt, an attractive proposal that combines fashion and ecology, by the hand of designers highly sensitized to the environmental problems facing the planet.<!--:-->','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('1aab0404-d697-4b8b-9b4c-ed24a8d5e1ca','template','','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('6eab4668-3329-4e86-81d8-fcc97b906f0a','has_comments','1','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('bc47298c-0a36-496a-a280-4ea390d8e673','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ambientarrrt-nov2009.jpg','20bbbcf0-63ad-4db3-9427-5831ce15bf32','Post','2022-01-31 02:07:36','2022-01-31 02:07:36'),('8e519fce-d9a2-4350-abad-67e9670712ea','slug','marzo-tortuguero-con-rao-anzoategui,turtle-march-with-rao-anzoategui','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('f6460ff1-2df4-4b83-bf8f-4ee7c10dfc04','summary','<!--:es-->Para el equipo de RAO Anzoátegui, Marzo fue un mes interesante tanto en tierra firme como en el agua.\r\n\r\nAcudiendo a una invitación del área hotelera del Estado, el \"Hotel Cristina Suites\" ofreció sus espacios para compartir con los turistas y familiares hospedados, la vida y problemática ambiental que atraviesan las tortugas marinas.<!--:--><!--:en-->For the RAO Anzoátegui team, March was an interesting month both on land and in the water.\r\n\r\nIn response to an invitation from the State’s hotel area, the \"Hotel Cristina Suites\" offered its spaces to share with tourists and family members staying at the hotel, the life and environmental problems that sea turtles go through.<!--:-->','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('5081e970-e481-4bdd-a8ba-d73620223678','template','','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('2d7961d9-19f7-4ce7-81bb-a6de68958149','has_comments','1','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('efc3e784-78a7-496a-be25-1c8f90f7ee4d','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/rao_anz_epa_1.jpg','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('e1de9393-b7c6-4bef-a31b-e598cdc7a827','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','fec255a2-9c91-4fe9-990a-90a37b4ad162','Post','2022-01-31 15:29:29','2022-01-31 15:29:29'),('999e701c-0044-4ee7-bcd8-e5736414f209','slug','vi-edicion-de-limpieza-submarina,6th-edition-of-underwater-cleanup','82044517-3b5e-4aba-8389-525afd195ffd','Post','2022-02-01 02:44:52','2022-02-01 02:44:52'),('67561ae1-30d8-4d22-8bc9-b8ba278da96e','summary','<!--:es-->Desde el mes de abril, la RAO Anzoátegui ha recibido de diferentes voluntarios los reportes de varamientos de tortugas marinas en las playas de Boca de Uchire. Gracias a la acción de los funcionarios de Protección Civil, lugareños y turistas se ha logrado levantar información sobre la presencia de estos reptiles pero sin vida.<!--:--><!--:en-->Since April, RAO Anzoátegui has received reports of sea turtle strandings on the beaches of Boca de Uchire from different volunteers. Thanks to the actions of Civil Protection officials, locals, and tourists, we have been able to gather information on the presence of these reptiles, but without life.<!--:-->','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('1284edcc-15f0-4c58-9d24-2572313ad45f','template','','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('66501a02-ffe4-4932-8d00-eb8db76301dc','has_comments','1','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('6cc6e9c8-d1a3-42d9-a4bb-3909476a4f09','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/giant-tortoises-g8858ea3ca_640.jpg','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('79267dda-eb22-42ed-ae2a-dcbacc1a89a6','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','43fb644b-3874-44d8-af73-947f3a8121f3','Post','2022-01-31 15:43:18','2022-01-31 15:43:18'),('fbf131d2-eee7-4383-990f-7fcfb80861f1','slug','respeto-por-isla-la-tortuga-es-tambien-respeto-por-la-historia-ecologica-y-humana-del-pais,respect-for-la-tortuga-island-is-also-respect-for-the-ecological-and-human-history-of-the-country','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('0a7784dd-7266-4fe0-92bc-6fea937f39a4','summary','<!--:es-->Inventarios y nuevos registros de aves, análisis morfológicos de vegetación, seguimiento y estudio de poblaciones de tortugas marinas, identificación clara de problemas que atentan contra la diversas especies y sondeos sobre esponjas marinas, algas y corales, son parte de los avances del proyecto Caracterización Biológica y Oceanográfica que Fundación La Tortuga lleva a cabo desde hace varios años en la Dependencia Federal isla La Tortuga, a fin de comprender la dinámica ecológica del lugar y preservarlo, no por un capricho o simple deleite paisajístico, sino por su alta valoración ambiental como reserva de la biosfera.<!--:--><!--:en-->\r\nInventories and new records of birds, morphological analysis of vegetation, monitoring and study of sea turtle populations, clear identification of problems that threaten the various species, and surveys on marine sponges, algae, and corals, are part of the advances of the Biological and Oceanographic Characterization project that La Tortuga Foundation has been carrying out for several years in the Federal Unit La Tortuga Island, in order to understand the ecological dynamics of the place and preserve it, not for a whim or simple scenic delight, but for its high environmental value as a biosphere reserve.<!--:-->','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('c00f4238-851b-4e83-ba35-b63a72edad2d','template','','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('7a9a4088-e1af-485b-8cd5-afdce4401a3b','has_comments','1','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('0a4f5d04-2332-43b4-967e-cebad1a4a4b8','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/respeto-por-la-isla-la-tortuga.jpg','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('5fec0d68-b41b-448b-896d-7a68c4b866c8','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','6d46bf76-6e30-41ae-801d-afb9a6061c78','Post','2022-01-31 19:38:19','2022-01-31 19:38:19'),('3e4bb427-c989-436c-b1d3-6d7a7e722090','slug','presentacion-del-libro-conservacion-y-proteccion-de-tortugas-marinas-en-libros,presentation-of-the-book-conservation-and-protection-of-sea-turtles-in-books','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('94f717b6-90a0-48c3-8172-638b44be8131','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado jueves 21 de mayo, en la librería +Libros de la ciudad de Lechería, se llevó a cabo la presentación del libro \"Conservación y Protección de Tortugas Marinas\" de Fundación La Tortuga y editado por Fundación Empresas Polar, a través de un acostumbrado conversatorio que realiza esta librería todos los meses, dando oportunidad a la comunidad anzoatiguense de tener un contacto más directo con diferentes autores y sus obras para incentivar la lectura.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Thursday, May 21, at the +Libros bookstore in the city of Lechería, the presentation of the book \"Conservation and Protection of Sea Turtles\" by Fundación La Tortuga and edited by Fundación Empresas Polar took place, through the usual conversation that this bookstore holds every month, giving the Anzoatiguense community the opportunity to have a more direct contact with different authors and their works to encourage reading.<!--:-->','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('119cef5c-5e5f-4495-8135-982b1433a767','template','','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('1680b0fa-0f05-4bbd-8200-97dcf870da38','has_comments','1','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('006cc285-c9bb-494c-90c6-4ff9bef0ad32','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/libro7.jpg','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('3bcd040f-361c-4f14-9f05-d9e625a7b7b2','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','ee31e163-0f89-4a1f-b7eb-10ef096ae7a7','Post','2022-02-01 01:46:57','2022-02-01 01:46:57'),('860676e0-9708-4cbd-9bad-7374f184ebcf','summary','<!--:es-->El año 2010 es el año de la biodiversidad, grupos y asociaciones alrededor del mundo, se unen en este movimiento para canalizar actividades y mensajes conservacionistas.<!--:--><!--:en-->The year 2010 is the year of biodiversity, groups, and associations around the world, join in this movement to channel conservationist activities and messages.<!--:-->','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('ab96e7d7-9b0e-4367-b57f-45cecd996e11','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-se-asocia-a-la-onu-en-la-celebracion-del-aidb,la-tortuga-foundation-partners-with-the-un-in-the-celebration-of-the-iydd-1','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('ad2587b0-1029-4b32-a407-38dc7f7042f0','template','','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('2a4f4e3b-c5ca-4633-9d60-e9f22d785fbc','has_comments','1','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('21fe1891-91ac-4c49-b965-b352e0f92dd7','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/IYB2010_Logo_Spanish_grayscale.jpg','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('63d47523-18eb-433f-9c4b-b78721e22b74','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','7e035bab-3e3a-4895-ae26-67649e4b8d8b','Post','2022-02-01 02:01:42','2022-02-01 02:01:42'),('712aceb4-3162-4b48-b8a8-7c2e034705a6','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tortoise-g67917bb6d_640.jpg','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('82dd74b6-a582-4701-9e82-5f0daa966270','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 24 de octubre, un entusiasta grupo de alumnos del Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Henry Pittier (Lechería) al frente del profesor Rafael Palma, organizó en conjunto con Fundación La Tortuga, una jornada de saneamiento en Playa Los Canales de Lechería.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, October 24, an enthusiastic group of students from the Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Henry Pittier (Lechería) led by Professor Rafael Palma, organized together with Fundación La Tortuga, a cleanup day at Los Canales Beach in Lechería.<!--:-->','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:57:01','2022-02-02 14:57:01'),('513027f6-7177-4a4b-a98a-66c94ed6fb4a','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-participa-en-colectivo-de-educacion-estadal,la-tortuga-foundation-participates-in-state-education-collective','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('b1721c5e-cd11-46aa-b3dc-ca2c9b17bba9','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado lunes 14 de octubre, Fundación La Tortuga acudió a la Sede del Ministerio del Poder Popular para el Ambiente a una reunión con otras organizaciones del estado Anzoátegui que conforman el Colectivo Estadal de Educación Ambiental, con el fin de incorporarse a este trabajo en pro del ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Monday, October 14, La Tortuga Foundation attended a meeting at the headquarters of the Ministry of People’s Power for the Environment with other organizations of the state of Anzoátegui that make up the State Environmental Education Collective, in order to join this work for the environment.<!--:-->','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('8a24937b-6790-4d10-b7a7-c3e68a5d93b8','template','','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('d80f8d41-2624-4ff2-8fd2-ee87b9300c89','has_comments','1','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('d02ff074-0fa2-49ba-808d-749c8c2c7900','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tree-gb38314765_640.jpg','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('8d641386-d5cc-4525-ba7a-36d0a1dd3ae6','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','efe03ac5-dfed-4934-a777-d8bdf6fdf29e','Post','2022-01-31 16:10:05','2022-01-31 16:10:05'),('b8c26d9c-d7c6-46c3-b29e-9c1ea1a08054','slug','no-es-basura-son-materiales,its-not-garbage-its-materials','82459464-708a-4b57-87f9-acf9a2cefad4','Post','2022-01-31 18:11:00','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('28ed27f0-ae78-4a21-aed8-c3df7e214a4d','summary','<!--:es-->Fundación la Tortuga  una vez más, cumpliendo con uno de los objetivos del programa de capacitación y sensibilización ambiental: “no es basura, son materiales”, llevó a cabo el proyecto  de  “Climatización de la Churuata de reuniones” en la Aldea de Pescadores de Lechería, aplicando las 3R ambientales y generando un cambio social, responsable e inteligente  con el ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación la Tortuga, once again complying with one of the objectives of the training and environmental awareness program: \"it’s not garbage, it’s materials\", carried out the project \"Climate control of the meeting hall\" in the Fishermen’s Village of Lechería, applying the 3Rs environmental and generating a social, responsible and intelligent change with the environment.<!--:-->','82459464-708a-4b57-87f9-acf9a2cefad4','Post','2022-01-31 18:11:00','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('791c2c0d-36e8-4b60-ae34-ef5312c8d9e7','template','','82459464-708a-4b57-87f9-acf9a2cefad4','Post','2022-01-31 18:11:00','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('319f0a0a-57fc-427e-8985-00498f961c9c','slug','actividades-ambientalistas-buscan-la-conservacion-y-proteccion-de-la-fauna-marina,environmental-activities-aimed-at-the-conservation-and-protection-of-marine-fauna','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('729385ee-328a-44a3-8298-8ab0bee440be','summary','<!--:es-->El equipo de Fundación La Tortuga se trasladó, el pasado 28 de noviembre, al auditorio de la Sede de Ingeniería de la Universidad Gran Mariscal de Ayacucho (UGMA) para dictar una charla de sensibilización sobre las tortugas marinas como parte del proyecto RAO Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->On November 28, the Fundación La Tortuga team went to the auditorium of the Engineering Department of the Universidad Gran Mariscal de Ayacucho (Ugma) to give a talk on sea turtle awareness as part of the RAO Anzoátegui project.<!--:-->','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('b5f2e33b-9a2e-4d0c-a13d-63cb08886491','slug','mas-tortuguillos-al-mar,more-sea-turtles-in-the-sea','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('84a6784e-19ff-488e-b8f1-3ebf27281091','summary','<!--:es-->Durante el mes de septiembre, los miembros de RAO Anzoátegui acudieron a varias llamadas reportando eclosión de tortuguillos marinos en playas de Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->During the month of September, RAO Anzoátegui members responded to several calls reporting sea turtle hatchlings on Anzoátegui beaches.<!--:-->','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('70036875-78ec-4d0e-939a-12ad3294ed7b','template','','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('4f9ce9ab-06c7-48be-9226-fb73b5be1662','has_comments','1','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('5baa557e-77a5-4fdd-a67e-583fccadf41a','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/turtle-gae5e0be44_640.jpg','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('fdcece97-1b1e-470f-b4ef-2b5b66b83d8a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-01-31 16:15:38','2022-01-31 16:15:38'),('605af22b-be75-49e5-b8e3-4a9af1c7c292','template','','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('22a19c0a-c964-471f-9ae5-414a44fa7b9b','has_comments','1','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('87e9746d-81d2-4411-ac92-c591c4a8f353','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fish-ga1d2de3c8_640.jpg','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('36b33e2c-f7e5-45d4-8a40-9364c3bd4f6a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','e77530ae-b8ce-4cc1-a38c-96b959581456','Post','2022-01-31 18:06:01','2022-01-31 18:06:01'),('d5a4836a-b0b6-4810-ba7f-3842f8ed2ba4','has_comments','1','82459464-708a-4b57-87f9-acf9a2cefad4','Post','2022-01-31 18:11:00','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('5f3bdc51-f136-4112-8f86-3206fde27f13','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/aldea1.jpg','82459464-708a-4b57-87f9-acf9a2cefad4','Post','2022-01-31 18:11:00','2022-01-31 18:11:00'),('3bd19b81-1b42-4406-9628-c5b2790fc215','template','','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:40:32','2022-01-31 19:40:32'),('901fc650-dcaf-4cfd-825c-eff6d7e7e4c6','has_comments','1','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:40:32','2022-01-31 19:40:32'),('c469f1ac-617d-4dea-bc17-afb640db62e4','thumb','','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:40:32','2022-01-31 19:40:32'),('2b131016-ea2e-4a39-af06-139252ba0409','slug','la-tortuga-como-hotel-de-aves-migratorias,la-tortuga-as-a-migratory-bird-hotel','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:40:32','2022-01-31 19:41:32'),('d8ccb213-9daa-4bd0-8937-db8df35b0d62','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:41:32','2022-01-31 19:41:32'),('76e494ca-12db-4c91-8169-dc7ebcab564a','summary','<!--:es-->Durante la última salida del equipo RAO Anzoátegui fueron encontrados restos de redes de pesca abandonadas en las orillas de las playas. Estos plásticos son asesinos silenciosos pues muchos ejemplares de fauna marina quedan atrapados en ellos sin posibilidades de sobrevivir.<!--:--><!--:en-->During the last outing of the RAO Anzoátegui team, remains of abandoned fishing nets were found on the shores of the beaches. These plastics are silent killers because much marine fauna is trapped in them with no chance of survival.<!--:-->','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('e7d5786f-9656-44f7-ac43-f328a36f0181','template','','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('42f6d88a-a96f-4eb9-981a-ee0dcaa5910c','has_comments','1','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('2122283f-7e83-4472-ad8b-53330901efc8','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fishing-nets-g04c56cd99_640.jpg','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('81b01084-0f41-45b3-99fe-9111b2a5af8a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','5bf20d35-815c-4fed-8b27-84933fd60b2b','Post','2022-01-31 16:23:35','2022-01-31 16:23:35'),('4c21e0d0-49bb-4c16-80f5-6b703e7679f8','slug','se-dicto-taller-de-elaboracion-de-jabon-ecologico,ecological-soap-making-workshop-was-dictated','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('baa933ed-d770-4e9e-8594-858a2c20b60e','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 2 de abril, Fundación la Tortuga en alianza con la facilitadora Ileana Guzmán y su proyecto “Ternura Artesanal”, ofrecieron a las participantes de este taller una gran oportunidad de aprender de manera sencilla a elaborar jabones, a partir del aceite doméstico usado para su aprovechamiento consciente y a través de un proceso de saponificación en frio.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, April 2nd, Fundación la Tortuga in alliance with the facilitator Ileana Guzmán and her project \"Ternura Artesanal\", offered the participants of this workshop a great opportunity to learn in a simple way how to elaborate soaps, from used domestic oil for its conscious use and through a cold saponification process.<!--:-->','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('61d29017-91cc-4b06-8350-1a202fec260f','template','','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('3c98b3f1-b11f-455b-b3a1-b48edc84ea7a','has_comments','1','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('837f52d4-d17e-4e91-9280-023a4f8d1cd2','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/jabn3.jpg','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('ce8b0a88-e1c7-4ba2-a1c7-d32b07c177fe','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','4d5a2b37-8fa6-4209-bc12-fde6a87da0a2','Post','2022-01-31 18:19:53','2022-01-31 18:19:53'),('79980672-0c3e-452b-9f8d-3fef71b38880','summary','<!--:es-->Miles han sido los metros que se han recorrido en la isla La Tortuga para hacer observaciones y conteos de aves residentes y migratorias, como parte del estudio de avifauna que Fundación La Tortuga lleva a cabo en esta Dependencia Federal desde 2008, encabezado por el especialista Gedio Marín Espinoza. Hasta la fecha se han marcado cientos de individuos y se han hecho nuevos registros para la región, destacándose particularmente las aves limícolas, agrupadas en el orden de las Charadriiformes.<!--:--><!--:en-->Thousands of meters have been traveled on La Tortuga Island to make observations and counts of resident and migratory birds, as part of the avifauna study that La Tortuga Foundation has been carrying out in this Federal Unit since 2008, headed by the specialist Gedio Marín Espinoza. To date, hundreds of individuals have been tagged and new records have been made for the region, particularly highlighting waders, grouped in the order Charadriiformes.<!--:-->','3e7a02ea-f471-4725-8a6f-23e73024bca2','Post','2022-01-31 19:40:32','2022-01-31 19:42:32'),('7a683f66-07eb-4c6b-876c-9162fd6230e1','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/unomia/mural_del_coral_cerebro_incrustante-compressed.jpg','2f99e394-f9cf-4cbb-96b8-ff74783ac7ad','Post','2022-05-03 17:51:45','2022-05-03 17:54:36'),('434fb08e-6c17-486c-89dd-873471ebce52','template','','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:57:01','2022-02-02 14:57:01'),('1847e211-3e63-412d-aa72-8a7cd8706e2a','has_comments','1','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:57:01','2022-02-02 14:57:01'),('69e01d96-31b5-4f39-b296-ab1bcdeeffa3','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pittier11.jpg','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:57:01','2022-02-02 14:57:01'),('dc4ff8c5-6e56-4ddd-88e9-be2eea60ffc9','template','','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('580b4f17-8694-4d86-8597-754961d91c8a','slug','la-hora-del-planeta,earth-hour','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('ce414643-405e-4cf5-a834-3c50c0395214','has_comments','1','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('684fb690-a760-4026-904d-4f0ef16e2728','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hora-del-planeta.jpg','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('f1c69684-93cb-4176-8ed3-578fa71f3894','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 28 de marzo en las instalaciones de Fundación La Tortuga se celebró la Hora del Planeta 2015. Organizado por el Movimiento Soy Verde UDO, este evento contó con la presentación de Danzas \" Poética Tribal\" y música de jóvenes talentos locales, quienes bajo la luz de las velas encendidas tocaron para el deleite de los presentes.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, March 28th, Earth Hour 2015 was celebrated at the facilities of Fundación La Tortuga. Organized by the Movimiento Soy Verde UDO, this event featured the presentation of \"Poética Tribal\" dances and music of young local talents, who under the light of lit candles played to the delight of those present.<!--:-->','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('718152e5-dec3-410e-b651-09ad70fd4c27','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','b6a7da2f-4f8a-4254-a80f-4151623a1566','Post','2022-02-01 01:51:05','2022-02-01 01:51:05'),('f43a8cde-5558-4765-96d2-9d471a31d4ee','_default','{\"draft_status\":\"draft_child\"}','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:58:52','2022-02-02 14:58:52'),('ff7679b3-b158-425e-8d00-6aedd523a27d','slug','los-panales-desechables-una-pesadilla,disposable-diapers-a-nightmare','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('66f6fff6-50a0-4a16-8e96-41114607fba4','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/tapas_por_vidas_feb_2014.jpg','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('556d99d4-8573-4c18-a305-48bb2bcb6da1','visits','2724','de97551e-c6d0-4de1-aec9-9c519a009fde','Post','2022-02-01 16:46:13','2024-06-30 18:53:39'),('98c4d051-7582-4f20-b0c7-1baf268da4cd','visits','2701','11f8a913-0f7f-4377-bd8e-3be3ac37f086','Post','2022-01-20 07:08:34','2024-06-30 11:59:03'),('7415c7ee-3fc9-4fa5-93f7-2d2a68e26318','visits','2389','c99eee6d-51e9-477a-977a-a0d42cc502e9','Post','2022-02-01 04:25:37','2024-06-30 14:48:52'),('e8682444-2bfa-44fb-be62-a5fa56d6b6ac','visits','2468','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-02-01 16:46:16','2024-06-30 06:47:17'),('b97be477-2c9a-4638-a8a8-dcdea69cbe49','summary','<!--:es-->Para los miembros de la RAO Anzoátegui, quienes mensualmente caminan kilómetros de playas dentro del estudio sobre tortugas marinas, el Parque Nacional Mochima ofrece a todo visitante o lugareño los más espectaculares y variados paisajes, solo interrumpidos por la visión de grandes cantidades de basura y en donde los pañales desechables se encuentran cada vez más, arrojados sobre las arenas de las playas del estado.<!--:--><!--:en-->For the members of RAO Anzoátegui, who monthly walk kilometers of beaches within the sea turtle study, Mochima National Park offers to every visitor or local the most spectacular and varied landscapes, only interrupted by the sight of large amounts of garbage and where disposable diapers are found more and more, thrown on the sands of the beaches of the state.<!--:-->','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('d0a0c8c5-3de3-4982-9b04-3b6a5ea168b3','template','','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('c4b2b571-b36a-4020-ba6e-e5fc0ceb0705','has_comments','1','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('8d7983cc-7431-41a0-a8a5-34ff7f8f671e','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Pa%C3%B1al_Adri.jpg','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('48d49aaf-2605-4d14-b7ce-fd4a3e625f57','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','168c8c87-0ce4-475f-8574-ba77f93990f4','Post','2022-01-31 16:40:28','2022-01-31 16:40:28'),('6984e37e-59bb-49d4-8ebd-75b3d5748301','slug','la-hora-del-planeta,earth-hour','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:02:42','2022-02-02 15:02:42'),('3f09602e-b2a8-47cf-9d8b-c1d92db4bee2','slug','la-tortuga-as-a-migratory-bird-hotel-1,la-tortuga-as-a-migratory-bird-hotel-2','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('d9f81ad1-bb61-4e6e-9098-b9be50cde13e','summary','<!--:es-->Miles han sido los metros que se han recorrido en la isla La Tortuga para hacer observaciones y conteos de aves residentes y migratorias, como parte del estudio de avifauna que Fundación La Tortuga lleva a cabo en esta Dependencia Federal desde 2008, encabezado por el especialista Gedio Marín Espinoza. Hasta la fecha se han marcado cientos de individuos y se han hecho nuevos registros para la región, destacándose particularmente las aves limícolas, agrupadas en el orden de las Charadriiformes.<!--:--><!--:en-->Thousands of meters have been traveled on La Tortuga Island to make observations and counts of resident and migratory birds, as part of the avifauna study that La Tortuga Foundation has been carrying out in this Federal Unit since 2008, headed by the specialist Gedio Marín Espinoza. To date, hundreds of individuals have been tagged and new records have been made for the region, particularly highlighting waders, grouped in the order Charadriiformes.<!--:-->','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('4362eeb0-a392-40d6-8b64-a83bf896ffa7','template','','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('914511aa-5dad-471d-ae0b-a5f1078d7199','has_comments','1','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('192f09ad-5af7-49f4-bfd6-df4c51d992a6','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-estrena-sala-virtual-de-educacion-ambiental,la-tortuga-foundation-launches-virtual-environmental-education-room','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('cde8d96f-bd7e-4c78-b484-022d090d84a1','summary','<!--:es-->Gracias al aporte de la empresa privada, Fundación La Tortuga puso en funcionamiento su \"Sala Virtual de Educación Ambiental\", con la incorporación de equipos de computación que facilitarán el acceso a información al público en general.<!--:--><!--:en-->Thanks to the contribution of private enterprise, La Tortuga Foundation has launched its \"Virtual Environmental Education Room\", with the incorporation of computer equipment that will facilitate access to information for the general <!--:-->','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('a07d497d-cf9c-4b07-96a6-db40ba1710dc','template','','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('7f62fd1e-315e-4923-b989-77446dd7568d','has_comments','1','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('24acf1a8-1501-4213-911b-b322d1f5ff38','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/sala3.jpg','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('e3114ed1-2327-40fd-873f-9865cbc3fd1e','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','71413578-e1d9-43c2-9987-9181ae288c27','Post','2022-01-31 18:45:10','2022-01-31 18:45:10'),('279d1338-740f-4a8e-a99f-0bbe744d5e57','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/aves-limicolas.jpg','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('fb933c04-51a3-4b2e-9a7f-99e9cbfc023f','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-01-31 19:49:04','2022-01-31 19:49:04'),('f71db565-d987-4bab-883a-c4b81c3ac0fd','summary','<!--:es-->Entre el 02 y 06 de noviembre de 2009, investigadores de Fundación La Tortuga tuvieron la oportunidad de mostrar sus trabajos en el VIII Congreso Venezolano de Ecología, evento llevado a cabo en Santa Ana de Coro, estado Falcón, para compartir avances y crear sinergia para continuar trabajando a favor del conocimiento de la biodiversidad nacional y el diseño de acertadas estrategias de conservación.<!--:--><!--:en-->Between November 2 and 6, 2009, researchers from Fundación La Tortuga had the opportunity to show their work at the VIII Venezuelan Ecology Congress, an event held in Santa Ana de Coro, Falcón state, to share advances and create synergy to continue working in favor of the knowledge of national biodiversity and the design of successful conservation strategies.<!--:-->','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('05020148-bb99-4588-8950-0b42577cf311','template','','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('cb26c706-69dc-427b-9bf1-6afd8ea93499','slug','investigadores-de-flt-compartieron-avances-en-viii-congreso-venezolano-de-ecologia,flt-researchers-shared-advances-at-the-viii-venezuelan-ecology-congress','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('54e80ef5-9a99-4bef-bb5a-fc35a3611932','has_comments','1','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('0f179f2b-6484-467e-b7b0-fae01f13c0c2','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/CE2009.11.07.jpg','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('01e6ea9f-3b16-4cf5-b684-74d9606fdc60','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','e7a2a616-5ae8-4c63-a813-b8a1158db09a','Post','2022-01-31 19:56:23','2022-01-31 19:56:23'),('db6fa923-3c75-432c-8ec0-8e071c12c81b','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('0ba216df-c865-4b21-839c-47a410e93bd0','visits','2','280f9376-12b8-4236-b202-03d14544bc7c','Post','2022-02-02 14:58:52','2022-02-02 18:55:42'),('2a4e1af6-476a-40b6-83a1-96ce0e73a757','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('21a0f0b3-5e26-41e6-b6ab-6ca64b2bfabd','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 28 de marzo en las instalaciones de Fundación La Tortuga se celebró la Hora del Planeta 2015. Organizado por el Movimiento Soy Verde UDO, este evento contó con la presentación de Danzas \" Poética Tribal\" y música de jóvenes talentos locales, quienes bajo la luz de las velas encendidas tocaron para el deleite de los presentes.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, March 28th, Earth Hour 2015 was celebrated at the facilities of Fundación La Tortuga. Organized by the Movimiento Soy Verde UDO, this event featured the presentation of \"Poética Tribal\" dances and music of young local talents, who under the light of lit candles played to the delight of those present.<!--:-->','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:02:42','2022-02-02 15:02:42'),('ac094fb8-5596-439b-9ca1-646603b80ab9','template','','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:02:42','2022-02-02 15:02:42'),('58d99855-5ee1-449c-85ad-5cfd19f88ee4','has_comments','1','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:02:42','2022-02-02 15:02:42'),('3412cdbb-3c99-4c38-b710-aa6b557777c8','slug','la-basura-no-abandona-las-playas,garbage-does-not-leave-the-beaches','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('d760c696-c0bf-4aee-9786-1a6f83935212','summary','<!--:es-->En el último recorrido de los miembros de RAO Anzoátegui, el pasado 17 de mayo, el acompañante asiduo a cada una de las caminatas fue la basura que inundan nuestras costas.<!--:--><!--:en-->In the last tour of the members of RAO Anzoátegui, last May 17, the regular companion to each of the walks was the garbage that floods our coasts.<!--:-->','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('6646a4c7-c665-4b41-997d-2b8c7de9a7e2','template','','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('9a095815-e497-4811-a65a-1f223fe24554','has_comments','1','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('bfc6dc7c-8c56-4251-a8c8-fea995ec8872','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/water-g06f867755_640.jpg','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('ac64e769-e0c5-48c3-a21c-e9d796023c7e','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-01-31 16:55:11','2022-01-31 16:55:11'),('21dd8331-e268-4309-908e-36aa0ea91884','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hora-del-planeta.jpg','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:02:42','2022-02-02 15:02:42'),('6ca53cbd-9343-460a-9509-b03d7f0b35b5','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','acc30805-f9ef-4ef1-beab-2901935d9ac1','Post','2022-02-02 15:03:42','2022-02-02 15:03:42'),('4e006390-ea4b-4e06-ac9a-64167354a02d','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/WhatsApp_Image_2022-02-09_at_09.01.28.jpeg','376f2668-0254-4ad5-93c2-398595b7da67','Post','2022-02-09 23:40:01','2022-02-09 23:40:01'),('c2379ec4-760f-4d10-9e46-ce65185e9664','summary','<!--:es-->El Plan Vacacional de Fundación La Tortuga llamado \"EcoRecreo 2015\" fue recibido con beneplácito por los padres y representantes que, año tras año, están pendientes de inscribir a sus hijos para que aprendan a valorar más a la naturaleza.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación La Tortuga’s Vacation Plan called \"EcoRecreo 2015\" was welcomed by parents and representatives who, year after year, are eager to enroll their children so that they can learn to value nature more.<!--:-->','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('220ce956-b67c-4581-8e1d-253bcfcbf416','template','','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('67490308-c125-42d7-9c57-a25f8b4f2d50','has_comments','1','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('b72118ed-897c-4b2f-a2c5-dfd156b8250c','slug','ecorecreo-2015complaciendo-peticiones,ecorecreo-2015fulfilling-requests-1','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('2c845303-1ead-4506-adbd-026a653f1531','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/eco2.jpg','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('60035485-1ca4-4556-a690-52cdf11f75f8','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','cf91ad58-9fdd-492a-8318-4a2d7046106d','Post','2022-01-31 18:52:52','2022-01-31 18:52:52'),('b85dbc6a-77a8-4ca0-9d31-6cad41f3c7bb','slug','rao-anzoategui-monitorea-actividad-de-anidacion,rao-anzoategui-monitors-nesting-activity','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('1dbd64d9-6e79-45da-b41f-0f340fccaa5c','summary','<!--:es-->Las tortugas marinas son parte de la fauna existente en los mares subtropicales y tropicales del planeta desde hace millones de años y uno de los aspectos más llamativos dentro de su ciclo de vida es el de regresar a la zona donde nacieron. Pero esto no sería resaltante si no tomáramos en cuenta que llegan a la madurez sexual alrededor de los 25-30 años.<!--:--><!--:en-->Sea turtles have been part of the existing fauna in the subtropical and tropical seas of the planet for millions of years and one of the most striking aspects of their life cycle is to return to the area where they were born. But this would not be remarkable if we did not take into account that they reach sexual maturity at around 25-30 years of age.<!--:-->','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('ed073783-a480-46c8-b732-30972ae2bf77','template','','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('5d06189f-da57-4ffb-a07d-9ef7962da307','has_comments','1','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('7b640c4c-8783-4737-b80a-208908467f34','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/turtle-g19ac1cd58_640.jpg','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('cb505958-5917-4a1a-abeb-0438ecbbc9e7','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','3d84f70d-8766-4325-a406-15fd9f0da977','Post','2022-01-31 17:10:43','2022-01-31 17:10:43'),('b4f30b56-1adf-4790-9126-e4c58fa0ae4b','slug','restos-de-tortuga-varada-tendrian-mas-de-un-ano-al-sol,the-remains-of-a-stranded-turtle-may-have-been-in-the-sun-for-more-than-a-year','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('3facc432-0d89-4402-90b7-c80dc87700c0','slug','continua-primer-ciclo-de-cine-ambiental-de-fundacion-la-tortuga,tortuga-foundations-first-environmental-film-series-continues','dcfd9cc7-2197-43b4-a9c9-b0afbaf0b055','Post','2022-02-01 02:06:47','2022-02-01 02:06:47'),('57830656-d0a9-40e8-8f14-cba82468fd0f','summary','<!--:es-->Durante las salidas de campo en las Isletas de Píritu del equipo RAO Anzoátegui fueron encontrados los restos de una tortuga Verde (Chelonia mydas) adulta con aproximadamente un año y medio de muerta.<!--:--><!--:en-->During field trips in the Isletas de Píritu by the RAO Anzoátegui team, the remains of an adult Green turtle (Chelonia mydas) were found approximately one and a half years dead.<!--:-->','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('288ee962-32cc-4371-a25e-d84b241c94b7','template','','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('f5ed9be4-f69b-48af-bd4e-558b5f7ba5b5','has_comments','1','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-01-31 17:17:59','2022-01-31 17:17:59'),('83738587-9c01-470d-92fc-e9890af1ab8d','summary','','04159b80-85b6-476c-b318-048e6c0575a8','Post','2022-02-04 15:12:25','2022-02-04 15:12:25'),('bffba265-de43-4f82-97d4-b7bf0c08f55b','_default','{\"email_info\":\"fundacionlatortuga@gmail.com\",\"phone_info\":\"+58 (412) 608 2679\",\"address_info\":\"Av. Américo Vespucio, cruce con Av. R-16 Lechería Anzoátegui 6016 Venezuela\",\"map_url\":\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Lecheria\\u0026t=\\u0026z=13\\u0026ie=UTF8\\u0026iwloc=\\u0026output=embed\"}','cf206389-65fe-438d-9546-db7ec70927df','Theme','2021-12-05 01:55:51','2022-02-04 14:49:05'),('de674cc1-2946-4e5a-b354-f550ba806074','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','376f2668-0254-4ad5-93c2-398595b7da67','Post','2022-02-09 23:40:01','2022-02-09 23:40:01'),('7e11379b-ad42-413f-8b8c-36d601f29b01','summary','<!--:es-->Nuevamente Fundación La Tortuga será beneficiada a través del Programa \"Ayudar es Sencillo\" de Ferreterías EPA, el cual consiste en el aporte voluntario de los clientes al momento de pagar sus compras. Ya el año pasado gracias al aporte obtenido se puso en marcha de manera formal el Proyecto \"RAO Anzoátegui\"/ Red de Aviso Oportuno que acaba de cumplir su primer año de trabajo mediante el monitoreo de las poblaciones de Tortugas Marinas en el estado Anzoátegui.<!--:--><!--:en-->Once again, La Tortuga Foundation will be benefited through the program \"Ayudar es Sencillo\" of Ferreterias EPA, which consists of the voluntary contribution of the clients at the moment of paying for their purchases. Last year, thanks to the contribution obtained, the \"RAO Anzoátegui\"/ Red de Aviso Oportuno Project was formally launched, which has just completed its first year of work by monitoring sea turtle populations in the state of Anzoátegui.<!--:-->','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('fae8ddbb-7ae0-4579-a97a-c943a4922e99','template','','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('16f92e79-fefa-429e-9ab2-50851241f8e2','has_comments','1','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('acae13ab-45ba-4939-896d-28d8427253ac','slug','liberados-59-tortuguillos-en-mochima,59-baby-turtles-released-in-mochima','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('589b732e-92a7-4ee4-b349-8eeaba6a8eb7','summary','<!--:es-->La Red de Aviso Oportuno, RAO Anzoátegui, se activó nuevamente al recibir el llamado de lugareños de playa Manare en el Parque Nacional Mochima quienes reportaron a Inparques el nacimiento de estos reptiles marinos en esta bella playa del oriente venezolano.<!--:--><!--:en-->The Anzoátegui Early Warning Network, RAO Anzoátegui, was activated again after receiving a call from locals of Manare beach in Mochima National Park who reported to Inparques the birth of these marine reptiles on this beautiful beach in eastern Venezuela.<!--:-->','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('a3d588e9-2150-4bbb-839b-c2081910fb73','template','','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('7dec6edd-fc5c-40fc-b763-3d3b148a9597','has_comments','1','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('ab3a71ba-25f1-4c47-8116-4d4b74944f32','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/babies-gf80caf35d_640.jpg','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('928bda40-b350-42b7-a012-be5e0f70b18b','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','db9908b2-ff77-4eab-b255-81e15a1d1539','Post','2022-01-31 17:27:00','2022-01-31 17:27:00'),('2db3db70-2bae-4438-a6d8-6385ddf4afde','slug','jornada-de-clasificacion-de-tapitas-en-fundacion-la-tortuga,day-of-sorting-plastic-bottle-caps-at-fundacion-la-tortuga','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('1d5263f9-541b-4b3e-82b9-b74d42874ed1','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 9 de agosto se dieron cita en la Sede de Fundación La Tortuga u nutrido grupo de jóvenes pata colaborar en la clasificación por colores de tapitas plásticas.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, August 9, a large group of young people gathered at the headquarters of Fundación La Tortuga to collaborate in the sorting of plastic caps by color.<!--:-->','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('053ec79b-c4f1-47b3-ad35-e0722f4fb310','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Logo_RAO-.jpg','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('e1ea1e91-d4cf-487a-aaf5-d237ef763d2d','template','','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('bf020e20-3063-4221-bf54-3715157af0d1','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('23dd2379-753d-4797-b4b7-7fda8a39dea7','has_comments','1','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('c418de06-c930-4b88-94ad-c7adbc4c46c4','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/plastic-screw-caps-g889943dc7_640.jpg','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('eefda635-59e8-48b1-85fa-ca9ef4220556','slug','de-nuevo-con-ferreterias-epa-1,again-with-ferreterias-epa-1','c9916979-1d61-4ffb-946a-ee5fad2eddcd','Post','2022-01-31 17:33:37','2022-01-31 17:33:37'),('b0ad1e28-7df3-4adc-ae1d-2171e0f69885','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','1b584348-465a-4c1b-a063-cfc91ee7e6f6','Post','2022-01-31 19:05:38','2022-01-31 19:05:38'),('7eea1489-58ba-49ad-b513-ef71b02589b2','summary','<!--:es-->Diferentes puntos de vista serán proyectados para despertar el sentido crítico de los cinéfilos sobre la responsabilidad que recae, o no, sobre la raza humana el tema del llamado cambio climático.<!--:--><!--:en-->Different points of view will be screened to awaken the critical sense of moviegoers about the responsibility that falls, or not, on the human race on the issue of the so-called climate change.<!--:-->','dcfd9cc7-2197-43b4-a9c9-b0afbaf0b055','Post','2022-02-01 02:06:47','2022-02-01 02:06:47'),('aca3a6fb-3205-4414-bd71-91689ee41e51','template','','dcfd9cc7-2197-43b4-a9c9-b0afbaf0b055','Post','2022-02-01 02:06:47','2022-02-01 02:06:47'),('8868c915-bed3-4036-b35c-a58af1a91e4b','has_comments','1','dcfd9cc7-2197-43b4-a9c9-b0afbaf0b055','Post','2022-02-01 02:06:48','2022-02-01 02:06:48'),('26070317-2297-4136-93ca-c3c4adfdfd45','summary','<!--:es-->Fundación La Tortuga se une a la hermosa campaña de la organización \"Tapas por Vidas\" sirviendo como Centro de Recolección. Las tapas plásticas acopiadas en nuestra Sede se enviaron a Valencia, donde fueron recibidas y recicladas para regalar sonrisas a niños con cáncer. Cualquier tapa plástica sirve, no importa tamaño, color, ni forma...el único requisito es ser una tapa plástica.<!--:--><!--:en-->Fundación La Tortuga joins the beautiful campaign of the organization \"Tapas por Vidas\" serving as a Collection Center. The plastic caps collected at our headquarters were sent to Valencia, where they were received and recycled to give smiles to children with cancer. Any plastic lid will do, no matter the size, color or shape...the only requirement is to be a plastic lid.<!--:-->','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('45001b51-330d-406c-a1c4-3bc311b0ea57','template','','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('fcf7091c-b2fd-4c53-bbf2-0389a68a6f6b','has_comments','1','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('0203b445-03ce-4b71-b97d-424a444f8cc2','slug','tapas-por-vidas-en-fundacion-la-tortuga,tapas-por-vidas-at-la-tortuga-foundation','5e20bbe8-2004-4e53-aa0c-d708a666d3e8','Post','2022-01-31 19:11:23','2022-01-31 19:11:23'),('5b66b04a-3e61-4433-9ab7-6c4f3c0968e4','slug','ninos-de-la-ue-francisco-lazo-marti-conocieron-a-las-tortugas,children-from-the-francisco-lazo-marti-school-got-to-know-the-turtles','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:02','2022-01-31 17:41:02'),('bfe39066-f0f1-43c7-86ec-29bb773c499d','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado viernes 13 de julio los niños del 2do. grado de la UE Francisco Lazo Martí culminaron su período escolar con una salida muy enriquecedora. Comenzaron con una visita guiada al Museo Dimitrios Demu, donde pudieron pasear por el mundo fantástico que construyó este ejemplar artista en nuestra ciudad recibiendo toda la interesante información del personal del museo sobre su vida y obra. Luego se dirigieron a la Sede de Fundación La Tortuga donde fueron recibidos por el personal de Rao Anzoátegui para conocer el maravilloso mundo de las tortugas marinas.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Friday, July 13, the children of the 2nd grade of UE Francisco Lazo Martí culminated their school term with a very enriching outing. They started with a guided visit to the Dimitrios Demu Museum, where they were able to walk through the fantastic world that this exemplary artist built in our city, receiving all the interesting information from the museum staff about his life and work. Then they went to the headquarters of La Tortuga Foundation where they were welcomed by the staff of Rao Anzoátegui to learn about the wonderful world of sea turtles.\r\n<!--:-->','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:02','2022-01-31 17:41:02'),('6827ca37-5d7d-4419-b6db-e7d6ac1f25eb','template','','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:02','2022-01-31 17:41:02'),('1a539d79-d12b-4b9f-8f54-53e811b39804','has_comments','1','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:02','2022-01-31 17:41:02'),('4885ab9f-d93e-4344-9f56-39dab3bd76a4','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Imagen1.jpg','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:02','2022-01-31 17:41:02'),('be6b8fb1-8d99-4610-8caa-ff5a2dc17980','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-01-31 17:41:03','2022-01-31 17:41:03'),('d60e3c89-6667-46cc-af55-848b7148cf06','template','','04159b80-85b6-476c-b318-048e6c0575a8','Post','2022-02-04 15:12:25','2022-02-04 15:12:25'),('8df891f5-9101-4ca0-82a0-f886ff02f4d2','summary','<!--:es-->Durante los días 7 y 8 de junio se desarrolló en la población de Rio Caribe el \"Taller Para la Conservación de Tortugas Marinas\" convocado por la Oficina Nacional de Diversidad Biológica del Ministerio del Poder Popular para el Ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->On June 7 and 8, the \"Sea Turtle Conservation Workshop\" was held in the town of Rio Caribe, organized by the National Biodiversity Office of the Ministry of People’s Power for the Environment.<!--:-->','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('5426ff0b-5fb9-4174-9b64-c770cb0af35d','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-solicita-al-ejecutivo-nacional-ser-incorporados-a-la-comision-tecnica-que-supervisa-los-planes-de-desarrollo-turistico-de-isla-la-tortuga,la-tortuga-foundation-requests-the-national-executive-to-be-incorporated-into-the-technical-commission-that-oversees-the-tourism-development-plans-for-la-tortuga-island','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('0ff9f45f-c724-4fb8-a200-80cfa01c6f0c','summary','<!--:es-->“Antes de iniciar algún proyecto turístico en La Tortuga, es necesario restaurar el sector ambientalmente devastado en 2007”<!--:--><!--:en-->\"Before initiating any tourism project in La Tortuga, it is necessary to restore the sector environmentally devastated in 2007.\"<!--:-->','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('a0c965a9-59fa-47ab-8ca3-0cbbbda38f8d','template','','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('990352f5-f7d5-4096-a571-7f94397739da','has_comments','1','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('f4f5829d-3fcb-4b36-a95b-ea030393fb89','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/FLT_imagen_de_archivo.jpg','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('94c39231-141a-495f-8419-a164a1838059','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','9383f03c-2ca0-4139-9b99-9c2a9faa0ee9','Post','2022-01-31 19:20:19','2022-01-31 19:20:19'),('ae8e12e9-f335-42d0-929f-932def9116ae','template','','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('cc17e0eb-244e-4d25-a306-c037ac9d240b','has_comments','1','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('60d9a458-ad42-41a6-bc94-01886c45e9e7','slug','realizado-taller-para-la-conservacion-de-tortugas-marinas,workshop-for-the-conservation-of-sea-turtles-held','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('7c222316-608b-4e26-84e8-c57adc25afee','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/taller-tortugas-marinas-ondb.jpg','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('7cc537d2-07dd-4d60-b566-c990123bd36d','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','4b131b2c-11b5-499c-98a6-9970706ac3bb','Post','2022-01-31 19:27:24','2022-01-31 19:27:24'),('11074544-3ec6-477e-86b9-908cedcfa323','slug','segundo-ciclo-cine-y-buen-ambiente,second-cycle-cinema-and-good-environment','ec6d6b72-18a5-4d54-bd0f-9dc6aebab972','Post','2022-01-31 20:02:11','2022-01-31 20:02:11'),('bec0a29d-52f6-4f78-9548-b95ad199bd48','summary','<!--:es-->Las placenteras instalaciones de Fundación la Tortuga en Lechería, Estado Anzoátegui, recibieron el pasado viernes 18 de Marzo al público anzoatiguense para disfrutar de la segunda entrega de los CICLOS DE CINE denominados “CINE Y BUEN AMBIENTE”, donde se proyectaron cinco cortometrajes del genero SUSPENSO realizados por estudiantes de la región, y donde también se aprovechó de manera informal, interactuar con los jóvenes realizadores.<!--:--><!--:en-->The pleasant facilities of Fundación La Tortuga in Lechería, Anzoátegui State, received last Friday, March 18, the theturtlefoundation of Anzoátegui to enjoy the second installment of the FILM CYCLES called \"CINEMA AND GOOD ENVIRONMENT\", where five short films of the genre SUSPENSO made by students of the region were screened, and where they also took the opportunity to interact informally with the young filmmakers.<!--:-->','ec6d6b72-18a5-4d54-bd0f-9dc6aebab972','Post','2022-01-31 20:02:11','2022-01-31 20:02:11'),('317784e6-e97f-4101-90b4-516282b790a3','template','','ec6d6b72-18a5-4d54-bd0f-9dc6aebab972','Post','2022-01-31 20:02:11','2022-01-31 20:02:11'),('07b1ef72-2c1f-47a5-8e9e-e24c15ab0454','has_comments','1','ec6d6b72-18a5-4d54-bd0f-9dc6aebab972','Post','2022-01-31 20:02:11','2022-01-31 20:02:11'),('19dd6786-c257-4722-ab9d-4fe1cf3fc06b','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/cine-y-buen-ambiente2.jpg','ec6d6b72-18a5-4d54-bd0f-9dc6aebab972','Post','2022-01-31 20:02:11','2022-01-31 20:02:11'),('c57d868c-d1ef-47e0-9638-13e62b962e5a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\"