70f1-c037-4d79-abab-8ed627a040c4','slug','microplasticos-en-las-playas-de-lecheria,microplastics-on-the-beaches-of-lecheria','043a7d30-93b8-4da8-ada2-776771919542','Post','2022-03-28 12:44:16','2022-03-28 12:44:16'),('f9b186d7-dbef-4c35-a824-aa14a2fdffad','summary','<!--:es-->El 10 de marzo de 2022 dimos la bienvenida al Grupo de Investigación de Geoquímica Aplicada de la UPTOS-Clodosbaldo Russián de Cumaná, estado Sucre, aliados de La Fundación La Tortuga. Estos profesionales han venido desarrollando investigación científica sobre el contenido de basura plástica y microplásticos en playas del estado Sucre desde el año 2018, siendo unos de los pioneros en desarrollar estudios sobre este tema en el país.<!--:--><!--:en-->On March 10, 2022, we welcomed the UPTOS-Clodosbaldo Russián Applied Geochemistry Research Group from Cumaná, Sucre state, allies of La Tortuga Foundation. These professionals have been developing scientific research on the content of plastic garbage and microplastics on beaches in the state of Sucre since 2018, being one of the pioneers in developing studies on this subject in the country.<!--:-->','043a7d30-93b8-4da8-ada2-776771919542','Post','2022-03-28 12:44:16','2022-03-28 12:44:16'),('e1a6aad7-49b1-4b3b-ad6b-8ba80c8349c0','template','','043a7d30-93b8-4da8-ada2-776771919542','Post','2022-03-28 12:44:16','2022-03-28 12:44:16'),('011554f3-00cd-4af5-b3c9-69004df8c43f','has_comments','1','043a7d30-93b8-4da8-ada2-776771919542','Post','2022-03-28 12:44:16','2022-03-28 12:44:16'),('7a194626-abee-42e1-a939-f5c7107253ce','_default','{\"draft_status\":\"draft_child\"}','12e0c85f-44ba-447e-bec6-5f3d3533e3e3','Post','2022-03-08 01:37:07','2022-03-08 01:37:07'),('71b5a1d9-52fa-436b-8145-3a3d1351f916','has_comments','1','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('45948dc5-a4d7-4995-9721-713e21a599d5','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-compartio-resultados-y-proyecciones-en-exponautica-2008,tortuga-foundation-shared-results-and-projections-at-exponautica-2008','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('8ba2cfcf-7029-474a-a129-abef70b503d4','summary','<!--:es-->Desde el viernes 20 hasta el martes 24 de junio Fundación La Tortuga compartió sus más recientes avances y próximos proyectos en la octava edición de Exponáutica, vitrina de novedades marítimas y plaza de productivas alianzas que cada año reúne más de 50 empresas comerciales y otras instituciones vinculadas con el sector náutico.<!--:--><!--:en-->From Friday June 20th to Tuesday June 24th La Tortuga Foundation shared its most recent advances and upcoming projects at the eighth edition of Exponáutica, a showcase of maritime innovations and productive alliances that each year brings together more than 50 commercial companies and other institutions linked to the nautical sector.<!--:-->','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('e25b9e89-a5bc-4eb7-bb95-74f1eb25b5bd','template','','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('e8e1f9ae-3114-4474-ad5f-d3dcdbee96ea','has_comments','1','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('2f040d06-afd5-498f-9952-409575006620','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/exponautica_2008.jpg','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('ab05fa52-424b-4ba2-9498-e4023c7613b9','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','2da39039-c212-4cde-a624-870f79012e73','Post','2022-02-01 02:13:40','2022-02-01 02:13:40'),('5b228a52-9640-4b98-963c-40740b04c8db','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/reunion_con_vecinos.jpg','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('c5d8eaa5-24cb-4b8c-9d42-6d6c423941ba','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('e5f77ef5-08a7-4e6d-aa1c-0c4a020e2ede','slug','fundacion-la-tortuga-presento-proyectos-a-vecinos-de-lecheria,la-tortuga-foundation-presented-projects-to-neighbors-of-lecheria','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('5d7bdab4-3625-4c7a-b598-ac8a348582b9','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado lunes 26 de mayo, Fundación La Tortuga invitó a las autoridades municipales y vecinos de Lechería a una reunión en la Sala Técnica de la Alcaldía de Urbaneja para presentar los proyectos que la fundación ecologista ejecuta en varias entidades del país y el uso que se le dará a su nueva sede ubicada en la calle Fermín Toro de la ciudad.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Monday, May 26, La Tortuga Foundation invited the municipal authorities and neighbors of Lechería to a meeting in the Technical Room of the Mayor’s Office of Urbaneja to present the projects that the environmental foundation is carrying out in various entities of the country and the use that will be made of its new headquarters located on Fermín Toro Street in the city.<!--:-->','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('93b5fcf4-015f-4e84-b4b6-9e81765ef99e','template','','6fe55121-67a4-474e-8047-cf3aa171cef0','Post','2022-02-01 02:20:20','2022-02-01 02:20:20'),('71c6b99c-5b33-4312-91ce-3e9008e9ee1b','slug','celebran-dia-mundial-de-playas-2021,celebran-dia-mundial-de-playas-2021','724cddfa-7aa9-41e4-a11f-3e219bae3cb0','Post','2022-02-13 00:15:00','2022-02-13 00:15:00'),('1995ac3f-4f85-4db6-bacc-13c01d14435c','summary','<!--:es-->Más de 150 voluntarios de Coca-Cola FEMSA, ONG y operadores turísticos recolectaron 2 toneladas de residuos, en el marco de Red por el Planeta; programa de sostenibilidad impulsado por la embotelladora de origen mexicano, que transforma los residuos en recursos. El trabajo se dejó sentir en varias playas del país.<!--:--><!--:en-->More than 150 volunteers from Coca-Cola FEMSA, NGOs and tour operators collected 2 tons of waste, within the framework of Red por el Planeta; sustainability program promoted by the bottler of Mexican origin, which transforms waste into resources. The work was felt on several beaches in the country.<!--:-->','724cddfa-7aa9-41e4-a11f-3e219bae3cb0','Post','2022-02-13 00:15:01','2022-02-13 00:15:01'),('783365aa-e5c1-4108-a2a9-4d6af65c6c70','template','','724cddfa-7aa9-41e4-a11f-3e219bae3cb0','Post','2022-02-13 00:15:01','2022-02-13 00:15:01'),('67466dd2-fd1f-4a0d-8e9f-9d33a80d25eb','visits','2487','1207f878-b895-4b85-9ac3-2036824a0e08','Post','2021-12-05 18:34:47','2024-06-30 17:31:12'),('2f170a25-7b08-4aec-aef9-e178ace8d145','visits','2565','3ea54008-f4fa-47a5-9726-c21bc88bba59','Post','2022-02-01 16:42:16','2024-06-30 09:44:03'),('5041c96c-e58d-4c5f-a9c8-0bdb6fc24bb5','visits','2360','faf7d2f4-4e2b-4e32-918f-4f510ac0f0b0','Post','2022-02-04 15:28:03','2024-06-30 09:57:10'),('07cfba4f-e115-4c95-8b55-3810f7200767','visits','2489','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-07 00:55:28','2024-06-30 16:38:43'),('d8fde0c6-1a35-4270-94b0-8c8fce2e5602','slug','vii-limpieza-submarina-2016-el-agua-y-el-empleo,vii-underwater-cleanup-2016-water-and-employment','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('25ba7351-23ee-46fe-a662-5dc7bed9f725','summary','<!--:es-->El sábado 19 de marzo, Fundación La Tortuga llevó a cabo su séptima edición de la Limpieza Submarina en la playa de Valle Seco acompañada de un entusiasta grupo de voluntarios.<!--:--><!--:en-->On Saturday, March 19, Fundación La Tortuga held its seventh edition of the Underwater Cleanup on the beach of Valle Seco accompanied by an enthusiastic group of volunteers.<!--:-->','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('6d326d6b-f303-46ea-b9b6-d11d0f84a776','template','','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('47937bcd-78bc-4d58-a266-c3990fe119ed','has_comments','1','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('1ac2ceaf-9b02-4e4d-9d8f-46d249381316','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/valleseco52.jpg','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('d43c62a5-e815-49b3-b006-b07e6a9c899b','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','f9efc96b-971a-4958-af9f-a88663568fc2','Post','2022-02-01 02:28:45','2022-02-01 02:28:45'),('dd8ca368-c335-4cd1-9424-d662182ff025','has_comments','0','724cddfa-7aa9-41e4-a11f-3e219bae3cb0','Post','2022-02-13 00:15:01','2022-02-13 00:15:01'),('987863ed-0648-42c8-a068-0503659085d1','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/un-grupo-de-voluntarios-realiza-su-trabajo-con-entusiasmo-en-el-dia-mundial-de-las-playas-84646.jpeg','724cddfa-7aa9-41e4-a11f-3e219bae3cb0','Post','2022-02-13 00:15:01','2022-02-13 00:15:01'),('9d5edc44-40ad-428e-9965-d01c5901afa0','slug','','98b0409b-cb1c-4c2b-bf52-30acc8d12363','Post','2022-02-13 00:19:56','2022-02-13 00:19:56'),('85a1a079-f3fe-4312-82d1-4116bd9935f0','template','','98b0409b-cb1c-4c2b-bf52-30acc8d12363','Post','2022-02-13 00:19:56','2022-02-13 00:19:56'),('f9986979-7cae-4da2-a2c3-a9fd7d8cd89c','layout','','98b0409b-cb1c-4c2b-bf52-30acc8d12363','Post','2022-02-13 00:19:56','2022-02-13 00:19:56'),('855f6c1b-d80f-4f0b-bd9e-cb3552bbe695','thumb','','98b0409b-cb1c-4c2b-bf52-30acc8d12363','Post','2022-02-13 00:19:56','2022-02-13 00:19:56'),('b279430d-1db0-4df5-88e5-a6676af703e3','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','f73c8f9d-cbc2-493a-af4a-4b16a320e8df','Category','2022-02-04 16:49:31','2022-02-04 16:49:31'),('9b2cf610-cf32-47d7-be2e-e619f6f452f9','slug','jornada-de-limpieza-en-playa-cangrejo,cleanup-day-at-cangrejo-beach','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('66d05a03-f41a-400a-9f52-d5be049ea152','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado 13 de febrero, alumnas del Colegio Integral El Manglar junto a su profesora, Victoria Viloria, acudieron a Playa Cangrejo a realizar una Jornada de Limpieza, dando así ejemplo de responsabilidad hacia el ambiente.<!--:--><!--:en-->On February 13, students from the Colegio Integral El Manglar together with their teacher, Victoria Viloria, went to Playa Cangrejo to carry out a cleaning day, setting an example of responsibility towards the environment.<!--:-->','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('9b4a0932-0049-4021-b932-2fa91561f199','template','','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('0386d2d0-5be3-481c-9edc-3dab2edf4901','has_comments','1','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('f5b3c421-0c9c-4892-bad9-5503b45c1730','thumb','','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('8fc9bebd-cf4a-40c6-8ee3-73e5f037b5a1','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','95b412d1-4623-4487-9f31-b425d4b48c71','Post','2022-02-01 02:33:10','2022-02-01 02:33:10'),('18ad06f8-3272-4c29-a14b-6fbfb108ea88','slug','mesa-tecnica-de-agua-y-fundacion-la-tortuga-1,iniaciamos-con--luz-verde-de-hidrocaribe-la-planta-para-tratar-aguas-servidas-','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-02-04 16:51:43'),('a302db8f-f4fc-4161-89da-0d4b2e71aa8b','template','','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-02-04 16:51:43'),('3e755174-43a7-4608-b5d7-c0b9541124c8','has_comments','1','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-02-04 16:51:43'),('35606caf-0d53-47ee-9684-9b9c67a3ec4a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-02-04 16:51:43'),('72c686bf-6f42-4be4-8504-0a0b62ba2ff2','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/123ees_1.jpeg','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-02-04 16:54:08'),('613fec3f-7fa9-4ac1-9c0e-4664c9afed0a','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:22:38','2022-02-13 00:22:38'),('4c0457a5-b912-4ddf-a57e-e186a8e19d3c','slug','convenio-marco-de-cooperacion-institucional-entre-la-fundacion-la-salle-de-ciencias-naturales-y-la-fundacion-la-tortuga-1,cooperacion-institucional-entre-la-fundacion-la-salle-de-ciencias-naturales-y-la-fundacion-la-tortuga','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:16:00','2022-03-09 16:16:00'),('b8dd8f53-3cf0-4c79-9c76-063d7b76d557','summary','<!--:es-->Celebramos el Convenio Marco de Cooperación Institucional que realizamos cerrando con broche de oro el  mes de Enero 2022, entre Fundación La Salle de Ciencias Naturales y  Fundación La Tortuga. \r\nEl presente convenio tiene por objeto estrechar los vínculos de cooperación entre ambas instituciones, a los fines de establecer planes que contribuyan al fortalecimiento mutuo en áreas técnicas, de investigación, docentes, desarrollo y asistencia técnica; así como el intercambio permanente de información y experiencias para la realización conjunta de proyectos y programas<!--:--><!--:en-->We celebrated the Framework Agreement for Institutional Cooperation that we carried out, closing with a flourish the month of January 2022, between Fundación La Salle de Ciencias Naturales and Fundación La Tortuga.\r\nThe purpose of this agreement is to strengthen the cooperation links between both institutions, in order to establish plans that contribute to mutual strengthening in technical, research, teaching, development and technical assistance areas; as well as the permanent exchange of information and experiences for the joint realization of projects and programs<!--:-->','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:16:00','2022-03-09 16:16:00'),('84624d5e-380b-4a16-abb9-7e7ca8e04fa5','visits','2','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:31:49','2022-02-13 00:34:50'),('eb92f814-2ab8-431e-a16d-9d886cbdea71','slug','luz-verde-para-el-proyecto-de-tratamiento-de-aguas-servidas--limpiaremos-nuestras-aguas,luz-vede-para-el-proyecto-de-1','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:21:38','2022-02-13 00:35:38'),('a14b61c6-e520-4bb9-8f94-5946e38ca93d','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"translate\":true}','588b50e2-67aa-4c69-9af3-89e2d110e603','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('9b2a14f4-158c-41e6-ba58-edd8903e434e','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"translate\":true}','dbed37f8-59a4-411a-8f59-1b002eff3fd8','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('064f4de0-bd17-44a4-aebb-0e6e6eac822b','_default','{\"field_key\":\"checkbox\"}','ba0b4ea5-26d6-4d54-80cd-ca34ac574fe9','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('228634d9-cd2c-4275-9213-2bda5d0e6ce9','summary','<!--:es-->El Presidente de Hidrocaribe Wimer Moreno nos recibió a la mesa Tecnica de Agua 1 y 2 del complejo turítico El Morro, con Fundación La Tortuga en  las oficinas principales de la hiddrológica  de la zona en la Avenida Municipal de Puerto La Cruz. Allí nos dirigimos  con la intención de solicitar su cooperación y desempeño para encontrar una respuesta ambiental adecuada a la problemática que venimos enfrentando desde hace ya varios años con el desbordamiento de las aguas servidas a los canales del complejo Turístico El Morro. . Las estaciones de bombeo de aguas servidas lamentablemente están diseñadas para rebosar a los canales, dado el estado que presentan y lo difícil que se ha hecho su mantenimiento ocurren constantemente descargas contaminantes a los canales en donde habitamos miles de personas. Necesitamos una planta para tratar las aguas servidas!<!--:--><!--:en-->The President of Hidrocaribe Wimer Moreno received us at the Water Technical Table 1 and 2 of the El Morro tourist complex, with Fundación La Tortuga at the main offices of the hydrological area in the Municipal Avenue of Puerto La Cruz. We are going there with the intention of requesting your cooperation and performance to find an adequate environmental response to the problem that we have been facing for several years with the overflow of sewage into the channels of the El Morro Tourist Complex. . Unfortunately, sewage pumping stations are designed to overflow into the canals, given their state and how difficult their maintenance has been, there are constant discharges of pollutants into the canals where thousands of people live. We need a plant to treat sewage!<!--:-->','790d98cb-7cb9-4776-af76-841fb65ab8db','Post','2022-02-04 16:51:43','2022-03-09 16:13:18'),('446b965d-0344-48cc-945f-dac19a4b05b9','template','','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:16:00','2022-03-09 16:16:00'),('d2cb1b18-749b-49ed-bb10-188ad6503e91','has_comments','1','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:16:00','2022-03-09 16:16:00'),('f9af6dfe-710a-4b8b-832d-79f27be39566','template','','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:21:38','2022-02-13 00:21:38'),('67132657-0742-49a1-8b60-739f548c7247','layout','','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:21:38','2022-02-13 00:21:38'),('56aace4a-d040-4ea8-bf9f-8ee69c02f7e2','thumb','','ec0bc671-2e07-43d4-a7d3-d397eab68339','Post','2022-02-13 00:21:38','2022-02-13 00:21:38'),('26508116-ca3a-4d13-a1af-6730a61b3c46','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado sábado 24 de octubre, un entusiasta grupo de alumnos del Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Henry Pittier (Lechería) al frente del profesor Rafael Palma, organizó en conjunto con Fundación La Tortuga, una jornada de saneamiento en Playa Los Canales de Lechería.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Saturday, October 24, an enthusiastic group of students from the Instituto Universitario de Tecnología Henry Pittier (Lechería) led by Professor Rafael Palma, organized together with Fundación La Tortuga, a cleanup day at Los Canales Beach in Lechería.<!--:-->','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:52','2022-02-01 02:37:52'),('c943cb10-4480-4cc2-ac88-65d4151ddc96','template','','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:52','2022-02-01 02:37:52'),('dd75c62d-47ab-4535-b3b6-d904c5d7498a','has_comments','1','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:52','2022-02-01 02:37:52'),('ca4d4601-dfb2-417f-86eb-bf6bf19f1694','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pittier11.jpg','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:52','2022-02-01 02:37:52'),('8f407274-f997-40b4-afc1-3b423c6f4a7d','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','eb4100c0-14d5-416a-b736-fd3e3114d9b8','Post','2022-02-01 02:37:52','2022-02-01 02:37:52'),('95aa59b3-994d-4a27-904f-5e9c08f99618','visits','1','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:47:20','2022-02-13 00:47:20'),('4999875e-5204-4e0d-8978-610b003bbb91','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/WhatsApp_Image_2022-01-28_at_21.56.09_2.jpeg','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:16:00','2022-03-09 16:16:00'),('e1f1a025-fe81-4567-99ab-de3c7bee1036','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\"}','425201eb-48de-467c-918e-e4c486be2f6d','Post','2022-03-09 16:17:00','2022-03-09 16:17:00'),('69b80fa2-10b6-47d4-8f3f-56673c241ddf','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"translate\":true}','6020a3af-42bc-47e4-af16-2b0ffc1d93e0','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('f79bed1d-cd87-4250-82d2-64c1740f201c','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"translate\":false}','da40d164-d98c-43a1-ac49-f21e943923e9','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('f18fe2b3-232f-479f-a50a-736d73a97abe','_default','{\"seo_title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"seo_description\":\"\",\"seo_author\":\"\",\"seo_image\":\"\",\"seo_canonical\":\"\",\"draft_status\":\"draft_child\"}','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:45:40','2022-03-09 16:12:02'),('73340e1f-e098-45dd-abf1-483f1ebb77b7','summary','<!--:es-->El Presidente de Hidrocaribe Wimer Moreno nos recibió a la mesa Tecnica de Agua 1 y 2 del complejo turítico El Morro, con Fundación La Tortuga en  las oficinas principales de la hiddrológica  de la zona en la Avenida Municipal de Puerto La Cruz. Allí nos dirigimos  con la intención de solicitar su cooperación y desempeño para encontrar una respuesta ambiental adecuada a la problemática que venimos enfrentando desde hace ya varios años con el desbordamiento de las aguas servidas a los canales del complejo Turístico El Morro. . Las estaciones de bombeo de aguas servidas lamentablemente están diseñadas para rebosar a los canales, dado el estado que presentan y lo difícil que se ha hecho su mantenimiento ocurren constantemente descargas contaminantes a los canales en donde habitamos miles de personas. Necesitamos una planta para tratar las aguas servidas!<!--:--><!--:en-->The President of Hidrocaribe Wimer Moreno received us at the Water Technical Table 1 and 2 of the El Morro tourist complex, with Fundación La Tortuga at the main offices of the hydrological area in the Municipal Avenue of Puerto La Cruz. We are going there with the intention of requesting your cooperation and performance to find an adequate environmental response to the problem that we have been facing for several years with the overflow of sewage into the channels of the El Morro Tourist Complex. . Unfortunately, sewage pumping stations are designed to overflow into the canals, given their state and how difficult their maintenance has been, there are constant discharges of pollutants into the canals where thousands of people live. We need a plant to treat sewage!<!--:-->','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:44:40','2022-03-09 16:12:03'),('6faf277e-9a07-43aa-98f1-f823bc21d3de','_default','{\"field_key\":\"numeric\",\"translate\":false}','527a0484-fbde-4d39-bf02-91e6463dae28','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('ed8ae519-6957-476c-abaf-0d673cac6389','visits','2308','377e5583-afac-46cc-ae4c-aab687b67c15','Post','2022-02-06 21:16:02','2024-06-30 16:31:55'),('894148f3-0a01-48a1-9527-a4f4abdd4d4b','visits','3060','f7ccf22a-bcf9-4b13-b406-e2f6f1a6615e','Post','2022-02-07 12:31:23','2024-06-30 18:33:12'),('da4364ca-7a34-4160-a5ef-d3ac955b9b43','visits','2439','cb1e1b3a-c0af-48aa-b6e6-239b77fb08ae','Post','2022-02-06 21:16:01','2024-06-30 05:28:29'),('b1553e0e-c38f-428f-b2e7-c5ba00518229','visits','2307','3f382e7e-26e4-419e-ae70-546e2de0a6c6','Post','2022-02-06 15:23:34','2024-06-30 12:23:12'),('113ea622-643d-4a9a-aea2-f35422e8181f','visits','2420','3695c155-78e6-485f-99e3-b3f077bc948b','Post','2022-02-08 22:04:21','2024-06-30 15:42:11'),('89f7067a-c745-4132-b2f7-72ac5d5d02c4','_default','{\"field_key\":\"text_box\",\"translate\":true}','4ba98efc-dbdc-464a-9765-2bd85ece971b','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('3bb16482-3cc6-425e-abee-07b5cafc1489','_default','{\"field_key\":\"url\"}','bd0267fe-03fc-4c6b-ae19-e098f4e143db','CustomField','2022-05-29 13:21:19','2022-05-29 13:21:19'),('886c6613-a31b-4f04-bfbf-5a4614a59db6','slug','mesa-tecnica-de-agua-y-fundacion-la-tortuga-1,iniaciamos-con--luz-verde-de-hidrocaribe-la-planta-para-tratar-aguas-servidas-','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:44:40','2022-02-13 00:44:40'),('0d8c874b-a197-49fe-9017-135a40f0f470','template','','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:44:40','2022-02-13 00:44:40'),('1ccd37e3-cbb9-4fe2-b3bc-dac50327bf38','has_comments','1','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:44:41','2022-02-13 00:44:41'),('485b82a9-6ead-4045-9741-b88f1f04debd','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/123ees_1.jpeg','bd015485-3182-43ce-801f-c37871bafa85','Post','2022-02-13 00:44:41','2022-02-13 00:44:41'),('42524e84-d3ed-4fa5-9a4f-c836d70b66df','summary','<!--:es-->El pasado domingo 22 de marzo Fundación La Tortuga, Inparques y Maru Marine Tours con un grupo de voluntarios, celebró la 6° Edición de Limpieza Submarina en el Parque Nacional Mochima en el marco del Día Mundial del Agua.<!--:--><!--:en-->Last Sunday, March 22nd, Fundación La Tortuga, Inparques and Maru Marine Tours with a group of volunteers celebrated the 6th Edition of the Underwater Cleanup in Mochima National Park in the framework of World Water Day.<!--:-->','82044517-3b5e-4aba-8389-525afd195ffd','Post','2022-02-01 02:44:52','2022-02-01 02:44:52'),('6180f004-6c2f-4dc2-b5b5-38a391735997','template','','82044517-3b5e-4aba-8389-525afd195ffd','Post','2022-02-01 02:44:52','2022-02-01 02:44:52'),('5ec6e7f1-5fcb-453b-8c9d-faecf05b5a30','has_comments','1','82044517-3b5e-4aba-8389-525afd195ffd','Post','2022-02-01 02:44:52','2022-02-01 02:44:52'),('4618b620-92d6-4374-9db3-1f12a9e432ff','thumb','https://theturtlefoundation.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/l19.jpg','82044517-3b5e-4aba-83